#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:52
msgid ""
"Result validity follows the selected operation's status and integrity "
"checks; a numeric zero or a recent software read is not independent evidence"
" of quality or freshness. Software observations retain their original "
"provenance and unknown physical uncertainty. The external touch calibration "
"reference belongs to `nexus-examples/recipes/control`, where measured axis "
"bounds and logical display orientation are explicit; the generic device does"
" not guess coefficients."
msgstr ""
"结果有效性遵循所选操作的状态及完整性检查；数值零或近期软件读回都不是独立的质量或新鲜度证据。软件观测保留原始来源和未知物理不确定度。外部触摸校准参考位于"
" `nexus-examples/recipes/control`，显式给出测得的轴边界和逻辑显示方向；通用器件不猜测系数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:59
msgid ""
"AT24C02 uncertain writes retain write-cycle responsibility until explicit "
"sync. W25 and SFUD select W25Q128JV rather than treating a JEDEC value as "
"complete suffix proof. Do not command one physical Flash through both "
"owners. SFUD uses caller workspace for private upstream state and exposes "
"the existing Flash face; products select regions and retain the same SPI "
"binding through uncertain program/erase cleanup. Successful readiness probes"
" do not repair an earlier failed write or authorize replay."
msgstr ""
"AT24C02 不确定写入保留 write-cycle 责任，直到显式 sync。W25 和 SFUD 选择 W25Q128JV，不把 JEDEC "
"值当成完整后缀证明。禁止两个 owner 同时向一个物理 Flash 发命令。SFUD 在调用者 workspace 中保存私有上游状态，并暴露既有 "
"Flash face；产品选择 region，在不确定 program／erase 的 cleanup 期间保留同一 SPI binding。成功 "
"readiness probe 不修复先前失败的写入，也不授权 replay。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:67
msgid ""
"Stop users before stopping the device, and stop the device before returning "
"its outer bus/GPIO/clock resources. A timeout can leave converter, display "
"or Flash effects even after CPU spans are released. No additional exact "
"device is selected by this reference (`not_selected`); physical HIL remains "
"`not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"先停止使用者，再停止器件，最后才归还器件外层 bus／GPIO／clock 资源。即使 CPU span 已释放，timeout 仍可能留下 "
"converter、display 或 Flash 效果。本参考不另选精确器件（`not_selected`）；物理 HIL 保持 "
"`not_executed`。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:73
msgid "TMP117 one-shot sampling contract"
msgstr "TMP117 单次采样合同"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:75
msgid ""
"Select `Nexus::TMP117` for the device protocol and `Nexus::TMP117I2C` for "
"its settled I2C adapter through the firmware target's `LIBRARIES`. These "
"optional CMake targets add no generated device category or competing "
"configuration input. The product supplies an already configured, fixed-"
"address endpoint, a monotonic clock, nonzero clock domain/epoch and the "
"expected existing digital offset. ADD0 wiring, power, bus scheduling and "
"physical recovery remain external. The [I/O ownership "
"architecture](../../../explanation/io-model.md) still applies; no sensor "
"worker, heap, address scan or additional owner framework is introduced."
msgstr ""
"在固件目标的 `LIBRARIES` 中选择 `Nexus::TMP117` 器件协议与 `Nexus::TMP117I2C` 已结清 I2C "
"适配器。这些可选 CMake 目标不新增生成式器件类别或另一套配置入口。产品提供已配置的固定地址端点、单调时钟、非零时钟域与 "
"epoch，以及预期的现有数字偏移。ADD0 接线、电源、总线调度和物理恢复由外部负责。[I/O "
"所有权架构](../../../explanation/io-model.md) 继续适用；不引入传感器工作线程、堆、地址扫描或额外的 owner "
"框架。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:84
msgid ""
"The reviewed device is TI TMP117 with complete identity `0x0117`, using one-"
"shot mode and one conversion with averaging disabled. Initialization checks "
"identity, EEPROM readiness and lock, verifies the existing offset, then "
"requests and reads back shutdown. It preserves unrelated configuration bits."
" Once shutdown is issued, a failed write or verification retains the same "
"port, configuration and clock as an uncertain uninitialized instance; "
"cleanup uses its own deadline. Earlier failures do not acquire a new "
"binding. `begin` clears stale readiness before requesting one conversion; "
"`poll` reads readiness and then the temperature. Each register read writes "
"the pointer and repeated-START reads two MSB-first bytes. Only the "
"synchronous endpoint transaction is accepted: every return, including "
"errors, releases its descriptors and TX/RX spans. An async-only endpoint "
"cannot be substituted for this settled contract."
msgstr ""
"已审查器件限定为完整标识 `0x0117` 的 TI TMP117，采用单次模式、一次转换并禁用平均。初始化检查标识、EEPROM "
"就绪和锁定状态，核对现有偏移，再请求并读回 shutdown 状态，保留无关配置位。一旦发出 shutdown "
"写入，写入或核验失败即保留相同端口、配置及时钟，将实例标记为未初始化且状态不确定；清理使用独立 "
"deadline。更早的失败不会取得新绑定。`begin` 先清除过期就绪状态再请求一次转换；`poll` "
"读取就绪状态后再读取温度。每次寄存器读取先写指针，再以重复 START "
"读取两个高字节在前的字节。仅接受同步端点事务：每次返回，包括错误，均结束对描述符和 TX/RX 存储区的使用。不能用仅支持异步的端点替代这一已结清合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:97
msgid ""
"A sample is published only on SUCCESS and contains independent numeric "
"values. BUSY and errors leave the complete output unchanged. Signed raw and "
"existing offset values use 1/128 Celsius per LSB. `micro_celsius` rounds to "
"the nearest microdegree, with exact ties away from zero; the full signed "
"format conversion fits `int32_t`. The reviewed output range is -55 to 150 "
"Celsius after the chip's existing offset. POR, saturation and values outside"
" that range return IO. The chip already applies its offset: the driver "
"verifies and reports it without adding it twice, programming calibration or "
"modifying EEPROM."
msgstr ""
"仅 SUCCESS 发布包含独立数值的样本。BUSY 和错误均保持整个输出不变。有符号原始值与现有偏移均以 1/128 摄氏度为一个 "
"LSB。`micro_celsius` 舍入至最近的微摄氏度，恰好位于中点时远离零；完整有符号格式的换算不会超出 "
"`int32_t`。已审查输出范围为芯片应用现有偏移之后的 -55 至 150 摄氏度。POR、饱和及超出该范围的值返回 "
"IO。芯片已经应用偏移：驱动仅核对并报告，不会重复相加、编程校准或修改 EEPROM。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:106
msgid ""
"`observed` reuses `nx_io_timestamp_t` with microsecond rate, explicit domain"
" and epoch, SERVICE_OBSERVATION provenance and unknown physical uncertainty."
" It is the time of successful register-read completion. The conversion "
"occurred between `conversion_started_at` and `observed.ticks`; neither field"
" is a hardware conversion timestamp. To enforce conservative maximum age, "
"compare the current time against the start bound after validating domain, "
"epoch and rate. A recent register read alone does not prove freshness. "
"Copies outlive device stop without retaining device, transport or sample-"
"buffer references; the consumer must still honor the clock continuity "
"assumptions."
msgstr ""
"`observed` 复用 `nx_io_timestamp_t`，采用微秒速率、显式时钟域与 epoch、SERVICE_OBSERVATION "
"来源，以及未知的物理不确定度。它表示成功读取寄存器的完成时间。转换发生于 `conversion_started_at` 与 "
"`observed.ticks` 之间；两者均非硬件转换时间戳。需要保守限制最大样本年龄时，先校验时钟域、epoch "
"和速率，再将当前时间与转换开始下界比较。最近读取寄存器本身不能证明数据新鲜。样本副本在器件 stop "
"后仍有效，不保留器件、传输或样本缓冲区引用；消费者仍须遵守时钟连续性假设。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:116
msgid ""
"All calls use one serialized task executor and finite absolute deadlines. "
"Poll checks the conversion deadline before and after exchange. A successful "
"not-ready read returns BUSY while retaining conversion metadata. Any "
"transport error, including transport BUSY, terminates sampling and requires "
"explicit resync; a CONFIG read clears readiness, so a subsequent failed "
"temperature read must not be retried as cached zero or as an endless not-"
"ready conversion. A second poll after one successful sample returns STATE. "
"Known overlapping control/output spans are rejected; the caller keeps opaque"
" context and borrowed bus storage disjoint because their extents cannot be "
"inferred by the generic driver."
msgstr ""
"所有调用由一个串行任务执行器执行，并使用有限绝对 deadline。Poll 在交换前后检查转换 deadline。成功读取到未就绪状态时返回 BUSY"
" 并保留转换元数据。任何传输错误，包括传输 BUSY，都会结束采样并要求显式重新同步；读取 CONFIG "
"会清除就绪标志，因此随后温度读取失败时，不能将其重试为缓存零值或无限未就绪转换。一次样本成功后再次 poll 返回 "
"STATE。已知控制与输出存储区重叠会被拒绝；由于通用驱动无法推断不透明上下文及借用总线存储的范围，调用者必须保证这些存储不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:126
msgid ""
"`cancel` uses a separate finite cleanup deadline and succeeds only after a "
"shutdown readback. It cannot preempt a synchronous exchange. Failed cleanup "
"retains the binding and external physical-recovery responsibility; a timeout"
" or error never proves physical stop. Retry cancellation or perform external"
" recovery, then explicitly reinitialize a closed instance. Only after calls "
"and outer owner users have joined may `stop` detach the software binding. "
"Stop has no I/O and does not power off the part, release Board resources or "
"erase an unresolved physical-recovery duty. An owner must not enqueue a "
"synchronous stack transaction behind its own executor."
msgstr ""
"`cancel` 使用独立的有限清理 deadline，只有读回 shutdown "
"状态后才成功。它不能抢占正在执行的同步交换。清理失败保留绑定及外部物理恢复责任；timeout "
"或错误从不证明物理停止。应重试取消或执行外部恢复，然后显式重新初始化已经关闭的实例。仅在调用和外层 owner 用户均已 join 后，`stop` "
"才可解除软件绑定。Stop 不执行 I/O，不关闭器件电源，不释放 Board 资源，也不消除尚未解决的物理恢复责任。Owner "
"不能把同步栈事务排到自身执行器之后。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:136
msgid ""
"The protocol follows TI **SNOSD82D**, June 2018 revised September 2022, "
"sections 6.5 and 7.3-7.6 ([official data "
"sheet](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tmp117.pdf)). One-shot conversion "
"takes 13/15.5/17.5 ms minimum/typical/maximum at AVG=00; the caller includes"
" bus and scheduling margin. Power-up readiness requires 1.5 ms and is "
"reported through bus/EEPROM status rather than a hidden sleep."
msgstr ""
"协议依据 TI **SNOSD82D**（2018 年 6 月，2022 年 9 月修订）第 6.5 节及第 7.3～7.6 "
"节（[官方数据手册](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tmp117.pdf)）。AVG=00 "
"时，单次转换的最短／典型／最长时间为 13／15.5／17.5 ms；调用者须另计总线和调度余量。上电就绪需要 1.5 ms，通过总线／EEPROM "
"状态报告，不进行隐式休眠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:144
msgid "Exact control, sensing and identity profiles"
msgstr "精确的控制、感知与身份 profile"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:146
msgid ""
"[AS5047P](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/as5047p/README.md) reads a command and then a "
"separate response frame. The old pipeline response is not the requested "
"angle. A binding must establish mode 1, MSB-first, at most 10 MHz and the "
"datasheet's CS setup/inactive/hold timing; a generic F4 SPI endpoint does "
"not establish that timing by its existence. Raw counts are not calibrated "
"position. [INA226](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/devices/ina226/README.md) uses one triggered"
" shunt/bus conversion, verifies calibration/configuration and propagates "
"not-ready and overflow. It is a power monitor, not a FOC phase-current "
"sampler."
msgstr ""
"[AS5047P](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/as5047p/README.md)先发送命令，再用独立帧读取应答。流水线中的旧应答不是本次请求的角度。绑定必须保证"
" mode 1、MSB-first、最高 10 MHz，以及数据手册规定的 CS 建立／非活动／保持时间；普通 F4 SPI "
"端点的存在不能证明这些时序。原始计数不是经过标定的位置。[INA226](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/ina226/README.md)执行一次触发式分流／总线转换，核验标定与配置，并传播未就绪和溢出状态。它用于电源监测，不是"
" FOC 相电流采样器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:155
msgid ""
"[LSM6DSOX](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/lsm6dsox/README.md) selects 104 Hz, ±4 g and ±500 "
"deg/s. DIRECT reads do not promise simultaneous six-axis capture. FIFO "
"vectors and 25 µs nominal timestamp ticks are independent tagged records; "
"the application establishes pairing, rollover handling and clock mapping. "
"Loss closes publication until explicit stop/reset/start. Read-completion "
"time is not the sample aperture. Calibration, mounting rotation and relative"
" attitude stay in the caller's algorithm state."
msgstr ""
"[LSM6DSOX](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/lsm6dsox/README.md)选择 104 Hz、±4 g 和 ±500 "
"deg/s。DIRECT 读取不承诺六轴同时采集。FIFO 向量与名义周期为 25 µs 的时间戳 tick "
"是相互独立的带标签记录；应用负责配对、回绕处理与时钟映射。发生丢失后关闭发布，直至显式 "
"stop/reset/start。读完成时间不是采样孔径。标定、安装旋转与相对姿态保留在调用者的算法状态中。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:163
msgid ""
"[OV2640](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/ov2640/README.md) controls the selected official "
"RGB565 modes; DCMI, frame storage, DMA and consumers remain separately "
"owned. [WM8978](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/wm8978/README.md) stages mute, VMID wait and "
"selected slave-I2S stereo playback control. Neither creates a capture/audio "
"transport. Current Qiming V4.1 references authorize control lines only; they"
" do not establish fitted modules or complete DVP/I2S wiring."
msgstr ""
"[OV2640](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/ov2640/README.md)控制选定的官方 RGB565 模式；DCMI、帧存储、DMA "
"和消费者分别持有所有权。[WM8978](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/devices/wm8978/README.md)分阶段执行静音、VMID 等待与选定的"
" slave-I2S 立体声播放控制。两者均不创建采集／音频 transport。当前启明 V4.1 参考只授权控制线，不证明模块已实装或 "
"DVP/I2S 接线完整。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:170
msgid ""
"The [ESP-AT profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/devices/esp_at/README.md) verifies the "
"module's exact AT core/bin report before setup. Credentials, network choice "
"and peer trust remain external. Its copied byte face and explicit "
"service/close are described in [protocol sessions](protocols/streams.md)."
msgstr ""
"[ESP-AT profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/devices/esp_at/README.md)在设置前核验模块精确的 AT "
"core/bin 版本报告。凭据、网络选择与对端信任由外部负责。采用复制语义的字节接口及显式 service/close "
"见[协议会话](protocols/streams.md)。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:175
msgid ""
"[ATECC608B](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/atecc608b/README.md) admits only the reviewed B "
"revision, both locked zones and a compatible existing private P256 slot. The"
" caller supplies bounded settled I2C, electrical wake/delay callbacks, "
"workspace and an explicit operation scope for context-free vendor hooks. It "
"exposes the [P256 signer](../io/system.md), not private key bytes, "
"provisioning, OTP writes, certificates or automatic TLS integration. "
"Serial/revision readback does not authenticate the fitted device. Failed "
"sleep retains the original binding for cleanup; join all signer users before"
" stopping it."
msgstr ""
"[ATECC608B](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/atecc608b/README.md)只接纳已审核的 B 修订、两个已锁定区域和兼容的已有 "
"private P256 slot。调用者提供有界且返回时已结清的 I2C、电气 wake/delay 回调、workspace，以及供厂商无 "
"context hook 使用的显式 operation scope。组件暴露 [P256 "
"signer](../io/system.md)，不暴露私钥字节、provision、OTP 写入、证书或自动 TLS "
"集成。序列号／修订回读不认证实装器件。sleep 失败保留原绑定用于清理；停止前必须会合全部 signer 用户。"

