#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "Bind an explicitly selected polling endpoint without I/O."
msgstr "绑定显式选择的轮询端点，不进行 I/O。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"Board A0-A2 must be low, WP low, exact 256-byte/8-byte-page device selected "
"and supplies valid. No discovery or runtime address introspection is "
"available through the opaque face; the caller must provide the exact "
"addressed endpoint. Async-only endpoints reject; no stack-buffer submit "
"fallback."
msgstr ""
"Board 的 A0-A2 必须为低，WP 必须为低，须选择精确的 256 字节/8 "
"字节页器件，且供电有效。不透明接口不提供发现或运行时地址自省；调用方必须提供精确寻址的端点。仅支持异步的端点会被拒绝，不回退为提交栈缓冲区。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero or successfully stopped storage"
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化存储，或已成功停止的存储"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] Fixed 7-bit 50h endpoint, alive through stop"
msgstr "[in] 固定 7 位地址 50h 的端点，持续有效直至停止"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] Same stable monotonic domain as endpoint deadlines"
msgstr "[in] 与端点截止时间相同且稳定的单调时钟域"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] Nonzero per-page polling attempt limit"
msgstr "[in] 非零的每页轮询尝试次数上限"

