msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, UNSUPPORTED or BUSY; no bus transaction"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、UNSUPPORTED 或 BUSY；不进行总线事务"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "Random-read an in-range nonempty byte span."
msgstr "随机读取范围内非空字节区间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"Word-address write plus repeated-START read is settled on every return. No "
"caller buffer is retained. On validation rejection no bus access or output "
"mutation occurs. A pending uncertain write requires explicit sync; no "
"automatic replay."
msgstr ""
"字地址写入加 repeated-START "
"读取是同步操作，每次返回时缓冲区借用均已结束。不会保留调用方缓冲区。校验拒绝时不访问总线，也不修改输出。待处理且结果不确定的写入要求显式 "
"sync；不会自动重放。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[inout] Initialized, idle, nonuncertain exclusive device"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、空闲且无不确定性的独占器件"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] First byte, 0 through 255"
msgstr "[in] 首字节，范围为 0 至 255"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[out] Separate writable span; may be partial after I/O error"
msgstr "[out] 独立可写存储区间；I/O 错误后可能仅部分有效"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] 1 through 256, not crossing the device boundary"
msgstr "[in] 1 至 256，不得越过器件边界"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] Finite absolute time, equality is expired"
msgstr "[in] 有限绝对时间，相等即视为过期"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, BUSY, TIMEOUT or exact bus error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、BUSY、TIMEOUT 或确切总线错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "Split a span at every physical page and await each cycle."
msgstr "在每个物理页边界拆分缓冲区范围，并等待各写周期完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"Readiness uses a settled one-byte current-address read. Only NACK during "
"this driver's issued cycle is retried; ARBITRATION, IO and other failures "
"are never called busy. The private current-address pointer may advance. "
"Probe-limit or failed withdrawal retains write_pending until sync under a "
"new cleanup budget; no MCU buffer survives any return. A write is "
"irreversible, non-atomic and not cancellable. Endurance, checksums, readback"
" and layout policy are external."
msgstr ""
"使用同步完成的单字节当前地址读取检查就绪。仅重试本驱动已发出写周期期间的 NACK；ARBITRATION、IO "
"和其他失败绝不视为忙。私有当前地址指针可能前移。探测次数耗尽或撤出失败会保留 write_pending，直至在新清理预算内 "
"sync；任何返回后都不保留对 MCU 缓冲区的访问。写入不可逆、非原子且不可取消。耐久性、校验和、读回和布局策略由外部负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle exclusive device"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、空闲且独占的器件"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] Separate immutable input, borrowed only during call"
msgstr "[in] 独立的不可变输入，仅在调用期间借用"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] Nonempty span wholly within the 256-byte device"
msgstr "[in] 完全位于 256 字节器件内部的非空存储区间"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] One finite absolute budget for all pages/probes"
msgstr "[in] 所有页／探测共用一个有限绝对预算"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[out] Separate result; unchanged on argument rejection"
msgstr "[out] 独立结果；参数被拒绝时保持不变"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after every page is ready; exact bus failure, TIMEOUT or BUSY "
"when the explicit probe limit is exhausted"
msgstr "仅每一页均就绪后返回 SUCCESS；否则返回确切总线错误、TIMEOUT，或在显式探测次数耗尽时返回 BUSY"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "Observe completion of a retained uncertain write cycle."
msgstr "观察保留的不确定写周期是否完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"No data write, replay, GPIO recovery, sleep or hidden worker. Readiness "
"never proves previous contents or write success. A synchronous call cannot "
"be preempted by another call."
msgstr "不写数据、不重放、不恢复 GPIO、不休眠，也不创建隐藏工作线程。就绪状态绝不证明先前内容或写入成功。同步调用不能被另一次调用抢占。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[inout] Same live endpoint and clock binding"
msgstr "[inout] 相同的有效端点与时钟绑定"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup budget, possibly later than write"
msgstr "[in] 有限清理预算，可以晚于写入预算"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "SUCCESS when idle; BUSY at probe limit, TIMEOUT or bus error"
msgstr "空闲时返回 SUCCESS；探测次数耗尽时返回 BUSY，或返回 TIMEOUT、总线错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "Drop only a quiescent fully drained software binding."
msgstr "仅解除已静止且完全排空的软件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"No bus access, controller stop or physical cancellation. A pending write "
"must first sync or remain owned for explicit external recovery; a timeout "
"cannot authorize forgetting it."
msgstr "不访问总线、停止控制器或执行物理取消。待完成写入必须先 sync，或保持所有权以供显式外部恢复；超时不能授权遗忘该责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "[inout] Serialized instance with no active call"
msgstr "[inout] 无活动调用的串行实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; BUSY retains active/uncertain binding"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；BUSY 保留活动/不确定绑定"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid "Results copied once at the end of an admitted write call."
msgstr "结果在已接纳写调用结束时一次性复制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"confirmed_bytes includes only pages whose write-cycle end was observed under"
" the operation deadline. uncertain marks an issued final page with unknown "
"outcome; its bytes must not be counted, replayed or consumed as confirmed. A"
" later sync proves readiness only and never repairs this result."
msgstr ""
"confirmed_bytes 仅包含在操作截止时间内已观察到写周期结束的页。uncertain "
"标记已发出但结果未知的最后一页；不得将该页字节计入、重放或视为已确认数据使用。后续 sync 仅证明器件已就绪，绝不会修正本次结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Exact caller-owned instance, fresh zero before first init."
msgstr "调用者拥有精确实例，首次 init 前须清零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:188
msgid ""
"Task-only, one serialized executor and exclusive endpoint current-address "
"pointer. No concurrent or reentrant calls. The immutable endpoint, ops, "
"opaque contexts and clock remain live and disjoint from device and payload "
"storage. Fields are implementation state, not reclaim permission."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，由一个执行者串行推进，并独占端点的当前地址指针。禁止并发或重入调用。不可变端点、ops、不透明上下文和时钟必须持续有效，且与器件状态及载荷存储互不重叠。字段属于实现状态，不能据此认定可以回收存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:192
msgid "w25.h"
msgstr "w25.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Bounded W25Q128JV commands and retained busy ownership."
msgstr "有界 W25Q128JV 命令及忙状态期间保留的所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "An explicit reviewed model; JEDEC identity alone is not suffix proof."
msgstr "显式指定已审阅的型号；仅有 JEDEC 身份不能证明型号后缀。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Last requested array operation, independent of its final outcome."
msgstr "最后请求的阵列操作，与其最终结果无关。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Probe one explicitly selected awake W25Q128JV through a polling face."
msgstr "通过轮询接口探测一个显式选择且已唤醒的 W25Q128JV。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"Task-only serialized calls; no worker, heap, lock, discovery fallback, reset"
" or status/QE/protection writes. JEDEC is necessary, not unique "
"model/revision proof. The caller excludes foreign flash, pin, power, clock "
"and bus owners. Endpoint, ops, context and clock outlive the component and "
"stay disjoint from state and writable payloads."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文中的串行化调用；不创建工作线程、堆、锁，不进行发现回退、复位或状态/QE/保护写入。JEDEC "
"是必要条件，不是型号/修订的唯一证明。调用方须排除其他 "
"Flash、引脚、电源、时钟和总线所有者。端点、ops、上下文和时钟的生命周期须长于组件，且与状态和可写载荷互不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[inout] Disjoint caller state, live through successful stop."
msgstr "[inout] 互不重叠的调用方状态，持续有效直至成功停止。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Stable mode 0/3, single-line, at most 50 MHz SPI binding."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的 mode 0/3、单线且最高 50 MHz 的 SPI 绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Ready monotonic microseconds, stable through pending duty."
msgstr "[in] 已就绪的单调微秒时钟，在待处理责任存续期间保持稳定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Explicit region/model/power/clock facts, copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 显式区域／型号／供电／时钟事实，成功时复制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in that same live clock epoch."
msgstr "[in] 同一个有效时钟纪元内的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after EF4018 and idle/non-suspended/WEL0 observation; BUSY before "
"ready_at or while the chip is busy/armed/suspended. Unknown models reject. "
"Rejection issues no mutating command."
msgstr ""
"观察到 EF4018 及空闲/未挂起/WEL0 后返回 SUCCESS；ready_at 前，或芯片忙/已置写使能/已挂起时返回 "
"BUSY。未知型号拒绝。拒绝不发出改变状态的命令。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Read one 1..252-byte region-relative chunk through command 03h."
msgstr "通过命令 03h 读取一个相对于区域的 1..252 字节块。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Every return ends CPU access to data. No asynchronous payload borrow."
msgstr "每次返回均终止 CPU 对数据的访问。不进行异步载荷借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[inout] Initialized, idle single owner."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、空闲的单一所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Offset inside the configured region."
msgstr "[in] 所配置区域内的偏移。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[out] Disjoint output, unchanged on any failed transaction."
msgstr "[out] 互不重叠的输出，任一事务失败时均保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Positive bounded byte count inside the region."
msgstr "[in] 区域内为正且有界的字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline covering complete CS withdrawal."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖 CS 完整撤出的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "SUCCESS or a checked range/state/transport/time error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或经检查的范围/状态/传输/时间错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Issue one bounded 02h page program without crossing its 256-byte page."
msgstr "发出一次有界 02h 页编程，不跨越其 256 字节页。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"Only pre-existing unprotected WPS0/CMP0/BP0 array mode is admitted. "
"Protection is never unlocked. No caller payload pointer is retained. This "
"does not verify bytes or promise atomic/durable replacement."
msgstr "仅接纳原已处于未保护 WPS0/CMP0/BP0 的阵列模式。绝不解锁保护。不保留调用方载荷指针。不验证字节，也不承诺原子/持久替换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle owner; retained while pending."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的空闲所有者；待处理期间持续保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Region-relative offset inside one physical page."
msgstr "[in] 相对区域起点的偏移，位于一个物理页内。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] 1..252 source bytes, no longer accessed after return."
msgstr "[in] 1..252 个源字节，返回后不再访问。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Positive bounded span; target obeys NOR 1-to-0 semantics."
msgstr "[in] 非空且有界的存储区间；目标遵循 NOR 的 1-to-0 语义。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline including later device busy time."
msgstr "[in] 包括后续器件忙碌时间的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means the command was issued, not completed. Validation rejection "
"has no I/O. A transport/time failure after write-enable may leave "
"pending/uncertain device duty; inspect status and service."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示命令已发出，不代表完成。校验拒绝不进行 I/O。写使能后的传输/时间失败可能留下待完成/不确定的器件责任；须检查 status 和 "
"service。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Issue 20h erase for one 4 KiB-aligned sector in the declared region."
msgstr "对声明区域内一个按 4 KiB 对齐的扇区发出 20h 擦除。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "No whole-chip erase, erase suspend, implicit retry or product policy."
msgstr "不执行整片擦除、擦除挂起、隐式重试或产品策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle owner retained through final service."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的空闲所有者，保留至最后一次 service 完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Region-relative, 4 KiB-aligned sector start."
msgstr "[in] 相对区域起点且按 4 KiB 对齐的扇区起始位置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Finite operation deadline; cannot preempt a flash pulse."
msgstr "[in] 有限操作截止时间；无法抢占 Flash 脉冲。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Same command-issued and uncertainty contract as program_start."
msgstr "命令已发出及不确定状态合同与 program_start 相同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Perform bounded status progress using a separate cleanup deadline."
msgstr "使用单独的清理截止时间进行有界状态推进。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"At most four short SPI transactions; no waiting loop. WRDI may clear an "
"observed idle WEL, then is checked. No reset, resume, unlock or replay. Lost"
" clock epochs retain pending duty. A quiescent device does not prove old "
"data, erase contents or power-loss outcome; read back under product policy. "
"Shared SPI recovery is the outer bus owner's duty."
msgstr ""
"最多执行四次短 SPI 事务，不进行等待循环。WRDI 可清除已观察到的空闲 "
"WEL，随后须进行检查。不复位、恢复、解锁或重放。时钟纪元丢失时仍保留待完成责任。器件静止不证明旧数据、擦除内容或掉电结果；须按产品策略读回。共享 "
"SPI 的恢复由外层总线所有者负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[inout] Same binding, storage and live clock retained."
msgstr "[inout] 保留相同绑定、存储和有效时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Fresh finite budget, never extends operation time."
msgstr "[in] 新的有限预算，绝不延长操作时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"BUSY while WIP remains set. SUS never establishes completion. After "
"WIP0/SUS0 and observed WEL0, pending duty ends and the original operation "
"outcome is returned, including a latched TIMEOUT/IO."
msgstr ""
"WIP 仍置位时返回 BUSY。SUS 从不证明完成。在 WIP0/SUS0 且观察到 WEL0 后，待完成责任结束，并返回原操作结果，包括已锁存的 "
"TIMEOUT/IO。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Observe component state and the last requested operation result."
msgstr "观察组件状态及最后请求的操作结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[in] Stable serialized state, no in-progress callback."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且串行使用的状态，无正在执行的回调。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[out] Disjoint caller output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 互不重叠的调用方输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/BUSY; no physical I/O or qualification inference."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/BUSY；不进行物理 I/O，也不推导资格。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Forget a known-quiescent component binding after callers join."
msgstr "调用方完成汇合后，解除已知静止的组件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"No I/O, bus stop, pin release, power-off or erasure of SPI owner faults."
msgstr "不进行 I/O、停止总线、释放引脚、断电或清除 SPI 所有者故障。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "[inout] State with no pending or uncertain array operation."
msgstr "[inout] 无待处理或不确定的阵列操作的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after unbinding; BUSY preserves state until service proves "
"settlement. Clock loss during a pending operation requires external system "
"recovery; a timeout never revokes that responsibility."
msgstr ""
"解除绑定后返回 SUCCESS；在 service 证明完全完成前，BUSY 保留状态。待完成操作期间时钟丢失需要外部系统恢复；超时绝不撤销该责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Explicit product region and stable power/clock identity declarations."
msgstr "显式产品区域及稳定的电源/时钟身份声明。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid ""
"Region offset/size are 4 KiB aligned, nonempty and inside the reviewed 16 "
"MiB array. Public offsets are relative to this caller-selected region. "
"ready_at is the absolute time after the actual rail has satisfied the "
"datasheet power-up/write delay; the caller must establish that fact. "
"Domain/epoch labels are declarations, not runtime clock attestation."
msgstr ""
"区域偏移/大小须按 4 KiB 对齐、非空，且位于已审阅的 16 MiB 阵列内。公共偏移相对于此调用方选定区域。ready_at "
"是实际电源轨已满足数据手册上电/写入延迟后的绝对时间；调用方须建立该事实。时钟域/纪元标签是声明，不是运行时时钟认证。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Caller-owned state, zero-initialized before its first initialization."
msgstr "调用方拥有的状态，首次初始化前须零初始化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Private fields are exposed for static allocation, not caller mutation."
msgstr "公开私有字段仅为静态分配，不供调用方修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:194
msgid "Serialized observation; SUCCESS never implies power-loss durability."
msgstr "串行化观察；SUCCESS 绝不意味着掉电持久性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:198
msgid "ili9341.h"
msgstr "ili9341.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Caller-owned ILI9341 RGB565 parallel-display controller."
msgstr "调用方拥有的 ILI9341 RGB565 并行显示控制器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Explicit cooperative initialization and uncertainty states."
msgstr "显式协作式初始化与不确定状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Verify ID 9341h and begin software-reset initialization."
msgstr "校验 ID 为 9341h，并开始软件复位初始化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"ID4 reads four low bytes: dummy, manufacturer, 93h, 41h. External NRST is "
"never driven. Call service after at least 120 ms reset recovery and 120 ms "
"sleep-out recovery. These are elapsed clock intervals, never loop-count "
"delays."
msgstr ""
"ID4 读取四个低字节：dummy、manufacturer、93h、41h。绝不驱动外部 NRST。复位恢复至少 120 ms、退出休眠恢复至少 "
"120 ms 后调用 service。这些是实际经过的时钟间隔，绝非循环计数延迟。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[inout] Zero/stopped or same-binding uncertain state."
msgstr "[inout] 零初始化／已停止状态，或相同绑定的不确定状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Stable immutable endpoint, clock and orientation."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且不可变的端点、时钟及方向。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline covering all phases."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖全部阶段的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after SWRESET, BUSY for a live instance or exact "
"validation/transport failure. Malformed inputs and a budget shorter than 240"
" ms cause no bus access. Once command D3h is attempted, failure retains "
"UNCERTAIN binding."
msgstr ""
"SWRESET 后返回 SUCCESS；实例已存活时返回 BUSY；或返回确切校验/传输错误。输入格式错误或预算不足 240 ms "
"时不访问总线。一旦尝试命令 D3h，失败便保留 UNCERTAIN 绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Progress at most one timed initialization transition."
msgstr "最多推进一次带时限的初始化状态转换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "No sleeping, spinning, scheduler, reset or backlight action."
msgstr "不休眠、不自旋、不运行调度器、不复位，也不操作背光。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[inout] Same serialized live instance and clock epoch."
msgstr "[inout] 同一个串行使用的有效实例及其时钟纪元。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"BUSY before the required interval or after sleep-out; SUCCESS after "
"RGB565/orientation/display-on programming, or exact failure retaining "
"UNCERTAIN binding."
msgstr ""
"规定间隔届满前或退出休眠后返回 BUSY；完成 RGB565/方向/显示开启编程后返回 SUCCESS；或返回确切错误并保留 UNCERTAIN 绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Write one complete in-bounds packed RGB565 rectangle."
msgstr "写入一个完整、未越界且紧凑排列的 RGB565 矩形。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"No clipping, rotation copy, heap or framebuffer is hidden. Interruption can "
"leave a partially updated physical panel."
msgstr "不隐藏裁剪、旋转复制、堆或帧缓冲区。中断操作可能使物理面板仅部分更新。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[inout] READY single-owner instance."
msgstr "[inout] 处于 READY 状态的单所有者实例。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Logical left coordinate."
msgstr "[in] 逻辑左坐标。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Logical top coordinate."
msgstr "[in] 逻辑上坐标。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Nonzero rectangle width."
msgstr "[in] 非零矩形宽度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Nonzero rectangle height."
msgstr "[in] 非零矩形高度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Stable packed native-halfword RGB565 span."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、紧凑排列且使用本机半字格式的 RGB565 存储区间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Exactly width times height, no implicit stride."
msgstr "[in] 恰好为宽度乘以高度，不隐含行步长。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"[out] Distinct completed pixel prefix, set to zero after admission and "
"updated even on a pixel-data failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立的已完成像素前缀计数，接纳后置零，即使像素数据传输失败也会更新。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline for all bus operations."
msgstr "[in] 全部总线操作共用的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only for all pixels, INVALID for malformed bounds, aliases or span, "
"or exact transport/time error. Rejection before bus access leaves written "
"unchanged. Post-command errors retain UNCERTAIN; no caller span survives "
"return."
msgstr ""
"仅全部像素写入后返回 SUCCESS；边界、别名或缓冲区范围无效时返回 INVALID；或返回确切传输/时间错误。总线访问前拒绝时 written "
"保持不变。命令之后的错误保留 UNCERTAIN；返回后不保留对调用方缓冲区的引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Send display-off and release the settled software binding."
msgstr "发送显示关闭命令，并解除同步操作及其借用均已结束的软件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"Does not power down the module, pulse shared NRST, withdraw the bus or set "
"backlight. The caller stops all components before releasing their transport "
"and platform resources."
msgstr "不会使模块断电、脉冲驱动共享 NRST、撤出总线或设置背光。调用方须先停止所有组件，再释放其传输和平台资源。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[inout] Stopped or same-owner live/uncertain instance."
msgstr "[inout] 已停止的实例，或同一所有者的有效／不确定实例。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "[in] Finite current deadline, independent of old init."
msgstr "[in] 当前的有限截止时间，独立于先前初始化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after all port access finishes, BUSY during reset or sleep-out quiet"
" time, or exact failure retaining the binding. An attempted command failure "
"keeps UNCERTAIN for explicit retry; validation never clears existing "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"所有端口访问结束后返回 SUCCESS；复位或退出休眠的静默期返回 BUSY；或返回确切错误并保留绑定。已尝试命令失败会保持 "
"UNCERTAIN，以供显式重试；校验绝不清除已有副作用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Explicit native orientation and RGB/BGR selection."
msgstr "显式原生方向及 RGB/BGR 选择。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"madctl permits MY/MX/MV and BGR only (mask E8h). Native addressing is 240 by"
" 320; MV exchanges logical dimensions. No module-specific gamma, power, scan"
" or voltage settings are guessed. Panel-specific additions require a "
"reviewed separate configuration; this is the controller reset profile with "
"16-bit RGB565 DBI and display-on. Configuration, endpoint, operations and "
"clock context remain immutable and alive until successful stop. "
"Reinitialization of UNCERTAIN state requires the same exact configuration "
"object."
msgstr ""
"madctl 仅允许 MY/MX/MV 和 BGR（掩码 E8h）。原生寻址尺寸为 240 × 320；MV 交换逻辑尺寸。不猜测模块专用的 "
"gamma、供电、扫描或电压设置。面板专用扩展必须使用单独审阅的配置；此处为控制器复位配置，使用 16 位 RGB565 DBI "
"并开启显示。配置、端点、操作表和时钟上下文必须保持不可变且有效，直至成功停止。重新初始化 UNCERTAIN 状态时，必须使用完全相同的配置对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid "Exact caller-owned state, zero before first initialize."
msgstr "调用方拥有的精确状态，首次 initialize 前须清零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:200
msgid ""
"One nonreentrant task owner; no concurrent calls. The configuration "
"reference survives initialization and uncertainty until successful stop. "
"Operations borrow spans only during the call. Errors after the first command"
" retain binding as UNCERTAIN until stop succeeds or the same exact binding "
"is reinitialized. Fields are implementation state, not permission to bypass "
"lifecycle checks. Software READY establishes completed commands, not optical"
" readiness or physical timing qualification. Caller spans are disjoint from "
"all transport and clock owner storage. Checks exclude known readonly objects"
" and context anchors; opaque owner extents remain the caller's "
"responsibility."
msgstr ""
"单个不可重入的任务所有者；不允许并发调用。配置引用在初始化和不确定状态期间持续有效，直至 stop "
"成功。操作仅在调用期间借用缓冲区范围。首个命令之后的错误将绑定保留为 UNCERTAIN，直至 stop "
"成功或以完全相同的绑定重新初始化。字段属于实现状态，不代表可绕过生命周期检查。软件 READY "
"证明命令已完成，不代表光学就绪或物理时序资格。调用方缓冲区范围须与所有传输和时钟所有者存储互不重叠。检查会拒绝与已知只读对象或上下文锚点的重叠；不透明所有者的完整存储范围仍由调用方负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:204
msgid "xpt2046.h"
msgstr "xpt2046.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "Explicit XPT2046 raw differential touch sampling."
msgstr "显式 XPT2046 原始差分触摸采样。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "Send one complete PD=00 conversion to establish PENIRQ mode."
msgstr "发送一次完整 PD=00 转换以建立 PENIRQ 模式。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid ""
"The chip has no identity read used here. Init does not establish physical "
"module fitting. A failed/short transfer may have changed converter power "
"state and retains recovery responsibility. Rebinding an uncertain device is "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"此处不读取该芯片的身份标识。初始化不证明模块已实际安装。失败或短传输可能已经改变转换器的电源状态，因此仍须保留恢复责任。禁止重新绑定处于不确定状态的器件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/stopped or same-binding uncertain state"
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化／已停止状态，或相同绑定的不确定状态"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[in] Stable disjoint exact binding, no chip-ID fallback"
msgstr "[in] 稳定、互不重叠的精确绑定，不回退到其他芯片 ID"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline, including the exchange"
msgstr "[in] 包括本次交换的有限绝对截止时间"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "SUCCESS or exact validation/transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或确切校验/传输错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "Read complete differential X/Y and optional Z1/Z2 samples."
msgstr "读取完整差分 X/Y 及可选 Z1/Z2 样本。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid ""
"Each conversion has its own complete 24-clock CS interval, differential "
"12-bit mode and PD=00. Any transfer error closes sampling until same-binding"
" init. IRQs are hints; the selected live pen predicate is checked "
"before/after I/O. Nonzero null/trailing bits reject the exact 12-bit wire "
"format; this is not a chip identity or fitting test. Output must also be "
"disjoint from opaque SPI/pen/clock context storage; only known spans are "
"checked here."
msgstr ""
"每次转换均有独立完整的 24 时钟 CS 区间，使用差分 12 位模式和 PD=00。任一传输错误都会关闭采样，直至以相同绑定重新 init。IRQ "
"只是提示；I/O 前后均检查选定的实时触笔谓词。空位/尾随位非零时，拒绝该不符合精确 12 "
"位线路格式的数据；这不是芯片身份或实装测试。输出还必须与不透明 SPI/触笔/时钟上下文存储互不重叠；此处仅检查已知存储范围。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[inout] Live exclusive initialized instance"
msgstr "[inout] 有效、独占且已初始化的实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[out] Separate aligned output, unchanged on every error"
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出，任一错误时均保持不变"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[in] One finite deadline for the complete sequence"
msgstr "[in] 完整序列共用一个有限截止时间"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY for pen-up, or exact validation/I/O error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；触笔抬起时为 EMPTY；或返回确切校验/I/O 错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "Restore converter PD=00 before releasing this device binding."
msgstr "恢复转换器 PD=00 后再释放此器件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid ""
"Does not stop the shared SPI owner, change pad modes or join external "
"GPIO/IRQ observers; those remain caller duties."
msgstr "不会停止共享 SPI 所有者、改变引脚模式或汇合外部 GPIO/IRQ 观察者；这些仍由调用方负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[inout] Initialized or uncertain exclusive instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化或处于不确定状态的独占实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "[in] Separate finite cleanup deadline when necessary"
msgstr "[in] 必要时提供独立的有限清理截止时间"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after complete cleanup conversion; failure preserves the "
"binding and recovery responsibility"
msgstr "仅完整清理转换完成后返回 SUCCESS；失败保留绑定及恢复责任"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "Exact immutable touch binding and explicit clock identity."
msgstr "精确且不可变的触摸绑定及显式时钟身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid ""
"SPI mode zero/MSB-first and actual settling/rate are owned by the selected "
"endpoint. Select exactly one GPIO pen face with one-bit mask, or an EXTI pen"
" face with mask zero. EXTI must provide the optional live electrical-level "
"method; buffered edges never substitute for that predicate. Pen is active-"
"low, not an interrupt count. GPIO/pull, endpoint, faces, opaque contexts and"
" clock live through successful device stop. The deadline clock must be the "
"same domain as the endpoint. Nonzero domain/epoch change on reset or "
"discontinuity. Every 24-clock exchange, including init/stop PD=00, must "
"finish before the earlier of the caller deadline and checked exchange start "
"plus 1600 us. This conservative full-exchange bound is postchecked even "
"after SPI SUCCESS; it is not a measured waveform or generic SPI edge limit."
msgstr ""
"SPI 模式零/MSB 优先及实际稳定时间/速率由选定端点负责。须精确选择一个具有仅含一位掩码的 GPIO 触笔接口，或一个掩码为零的 EXTI "
"触笔接口。EXTI "
"必须提供可选的实时电平方法；缓冲边沿绝不能代替该谓词。触笔低电平有效，不是中断计数。GPIO/上下拉、端点、接口、不透明上下文和时钟须存活至器件成功 "
"stop。截止时间时钟必须与端点处于同一时钟域。非零 domain/epoch 在复位或不连续时须改变。每次 24 时钟交换，包括 init/stop "
"的 PD=00，均须在调用方截止时间与经检查的交换起始时刻加 1600 us 两者中较早者之前完成。即使 SPI 返回 "
"SUCCESS，仍在返回后检查此保守的完整交换上限；它不是实测波形或通用 SPI 边沿限制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "Copied 12-bit converter values, without display calibration."
msgstr "复制的 12 位转换器数值，未经显示校准。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid ""
"x/y are channels 101/001; z1/z2 are 011/100 when requested. Axis rotation, "
"pressure resistance, filtering and gesture policy are external. Pen was low "
"before and after the sequence, which does not prove simultaneous conversions"
" or a stable physical contact. observed is software completion time with "
"unknown uncertainty, never conversion timestamp."
msgstr ""
"x/y 使用通道 101/001；请求压力值时，z1/z2 使用 "
"011/100。轴旋转、压力电阻、滤波和手势策略由外部提供。序列前后触笔均为低电平，不证明转换同时发生，也不证明物理接触稳定。observed "
"是不确定度未知的软件完成时间，绝不是转换时间戳。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid "Zero-initialized caller-owned serialized touch state."
msgstr "由调用方所有、零初始化并串行使用的触摸状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:206
msgid ""
"No payload pointer survives a call. Failed I/O retains the binding as "
"uncertain; recover the SPI owner first when needed, then retry same-binding "
"init or stop. No polling worker, debounce, IRQ owner or allocation is "
"introduced."
msgstr ""
"调用返回后不保留载荷指针。I/O 失败会将绑定保留为不确定状态；需要时先恢复 SPI 所有者，再以相同绑定重试 init 或 "
"stop。不引入轮询工作线程、消抖、IRQ 所有者或内存分配。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:210
msgid "ds18b20.h"
msgstr "ds18b20.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "External-VDD DS18B20 identity and cooperative conversion."
msgstr "外部 VDD 供电的 DS18B20 身份与协作式转换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "Validate identity, actual supply mode and scratchpad configuration."
msgstr "校验身份、实际供电模式及暂存器配置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "Initial scratchpad temperature, including85C, is never a fresh result."
msgstr "初始暂存器温度，包括 85C，绝不是新转换结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[inout] Zero/stopped disjoint stable state."
msgstr "[inout] 零初始化／已停止、稳定且互不重叠的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[in] Immutable exact selection, with initialized wire owner."
msgstr "[in] 精确不可变的选择，总线所有者已初始化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[in] Finite absolute communication budget."
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对通信预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED/IO."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED/IO。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "Read actual resolution then start one bounded autonomous conversion."
msgstr "读取实际分辨率，再启动一次有界自主转换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid ""
"Max waits are93750/187500/375000/750000us for9/10/11/12 bits. No blocking "
"conversion delay. Command execution may have effects even when a later "
"clock/budget observation fails; this is not cancellation."
msgstr ""
"9/10/11/12 位的最长等待分别为 "
"93750/187500/375000/750000us。不进行阻塞式转换延迟。即使后续时钟/预算观察失败，命令执行仍可能已产生副作用；这不代表取消。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized owner; no current conversion."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化并串行使用的所有者，当前无转换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[in] Finite overall communication/conversion/read budget."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖通信／转换／读取全过程的有限总预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "SUCCESS when issued; otherwise bounded validation/bus/clock error."
msgstr "已发出时返回 SUCCESS；否则返回有界校验/总线/时钟错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "After the real resolution maximum, read/CRC-validate a fresh result."
msgstr "实际分辨率对应的最长转换时间届满后，读取新结果并校验 CRC。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid ""
"Reads use a fresh reset/select, not a stale conversion-poll context. "
"Undefined low bits are cleared; valid85C is not rejected by value. "
"Temperature range is -55..125C. No UTC or product calibration policy."
msgstr ""
"读取使用新的复位/选择，不复用过期的转换轮询上下文。未定义的低位会清零；不会仅因值为有效的 85C 而拒绝。温度范围为 -55..125C。不提供 "
"UTC 或产品校准策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[inout] Same serialized state and live bus/clock epoch."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行状态及有效总线／时钟纪元。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[out] Separate signed1/16C output, unchanged on error."
msgstr "[out] 独立的有符号 1/16C 输出，错误时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid ""
"BUSY before ready without wire activity, SUCCESS once, or a bounded "
"timeout/clock/identity/CRC/configuration error closing admission."
msgstr "尚未就绪时返回 BUSY，且无线路活动；成功仅返回一次 SUCCESS；或返回有界的超时/时钟/身份/CRC/配置错误并关闭操作接纳。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "Close only software admission; never reset or release the shared bus."
msgstr "仅关闭软件操作接纳，绝不复位或释放共享总线。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "Physical conversion may continue; no physical cancel/off claim."
msgstr "物理转换可能继续；不声称已物理取消或断电。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "[inout] Stable same-executor state, no in-progress call."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者使用的稳定状态，无正在执行的调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "SUCCESS idempotently, INVALID or BUSY for an overlapping call."
msgstr "幂等返回 SUCCESS；或返回 INVALID；调用重叠时返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "Immutable selected sensor identity, not a bus or physical fitting."
msgstr "不可变的选定传感器身份，不代表总线或物理实装。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid ""
"Known ROM requires family28h and CRC8. Skip ROM additionally requires "
"explicit single_device=true, reads/retains its CRC-valid ROM and checks that"
" identity again for subsequent commands. external_vdd must be true and Read "
"Power Supply must confirm it; parasite mode is unsupported. Sensor power and"
" identity remain stable through each conversion."
msgstr ""
"已知 ROM 要求 family28h 和 CRC8。Skip ROM 还要求显式设置 single_device=true，读取/保留其 CRC "
"有效的 ROM，并在后续命令中再次检查该身份。external_vdd 必须为 true，且 Read Power Supply "
"必须予以确认；不支持寄生供电模式。每次转换期间传感器电源和身份须保持稳定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid "Caller-owned serialized device state; zero before first init."
msgstr "调用方拥有的串行化器件状态；首次 init 前须清零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:212
msgid ""
"Configuration, bus and clock contexts remain borrowed while open. Conversion"
" is autonomous; software stop/timeout never claims physical cancellation. No"
" task, heap, hidden queue, calibration or retained CPU payload. After "
"software closure and joins, no device reference remains."
msgstr ""
"绑定有效期间持续借用配置、总线和时钟上下文。转换自主进行；软件 stop/timeout 绝不声称已物理取消。不创建任务、堆、隐藏队列、校准或保留的 "
"CPU 载荷。软件关闭并完成汇合后，不再保留器件引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:216
msgid "infrared.h"
msgstr "infrared.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Bounded NEC decoding from copied active-low EXTI edges."
msgstr "对复制的低电平有效 EXTI 边沿进行有界 NEC 解码。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Explicit address policy; no inverse-error fallback is permitted."
msgstr "显式地址策略；不允许反码错误回退。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Strict by default; IRQ sampling is an explicit software reference."
msgstr "默认严格；IRQ 采样是显式软件参考。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Source declarations/flags never attest physical capture integrity."
msgstr "来源声明/标志绝不证明物理捕获完整性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Bind explicit timing/address policy without hardware access."
msgstr "绑定显式时序/地址策略，不访问硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero or successfully stopped, aligned storage."
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化存储，或已成功停止的存储；必须对齐。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "[in] Stable readonly policy, disjoint from owner."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的只读策略，与所有者存储互不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or BUSY; rejection leaves both spans unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 BUSY；拒绝时两个缓冲区范围均保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Consume one copied edge through the deterministic NEC state machine."
msgstr "通过确定性 NEC 状态机消费一个已复制的边沿。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid ""
"Feed exactly one bound input source to each owner; route multiplexed inputs "
"before this call. Unknown flags/edge and invalid spans reject unchanged. "
"Physical line numbers are not part of the decoder policy. LOSS invalidates "
"frame and repeat eligibility; its report timestamp is not a recovered edge "
"and never advances the source clock history. Accepted COALESCED samples "
"retain their observation time and flags. Equal/backward accepted timestamps "
"latch clock_fault until stop/init. Malformed/truncated frames never publish "
"partial commands. No RC5, NEC2 interpretation, automatic protocol discovery "
"or calibration."
msgstr ""
"每个 owner 仅消费一个已绑定的输入源；复用输入须在调用前按来源路由。未知标志／边沿和无效存储区间均被拒绝，状态保持不变。物理线号不属于 "
"decoder 策略。LOSS 使当前帧及重复帧资格失效；其报告时间戳不是恢复出的边沿，绝不推进来源时钟历史。接纳的 COALESCED "
"采样保留其观察时间和标志。接纳的时间戳若相等或回退，会锁存 clock_fault，直至 stop/init。畸形或截断帧绝不发布部分命令。不提供 "
"RC5、NEC2 解释、自动协议发现或校准。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "[inout] Initialized single consumer in its original epoch."
msgstr "[inout] 原始纪元内已初始化的单消费者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "[in] Disjoint copied public edge, borrowed only during call."
msgstr "[in] 已复制的公共边沿，与其他存储互不重叠，仅在调用期间借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid ""
"Value SUCCESS only after 32 valid bits and trailer or valid repeat; EMPTY "
"awaits more edges; OVERFLOW rejects LOSS in every policy and COALESCED in "
"STRICT. IRQ_OBSERVATION retains sampled uncertainty. IO rejects malformed "
"waveform/clock, TIMEOUT rejects a stale frame."
msgstr ""
"仅在收到 32 个有效位及尾部，或有效重复帧后返回 SUCCESS；EMPTY 表示等待更多边沿；OVERFLOW 在所有策略下拒绝 LOSS，并在 "
"STRICT 下拒绝 COALESCED。IRQ_OBSERVATION 保留采样不确定性。IO 拒绝畸形波形／时钟，TIMEOUT 拒绝过期帧。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Read at most one edge from a caller-owned public EXTI queue."
msgstr "从调用方拥有的公共 EXTI 队列最多读取一个边沿。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid ""
"Caller exclusively drains one physical source. This method does not "
"initialize, stop, attach a wake, recover or otherwise own that source. A "
"failed/inconsistent read invalidates frame and repeat history."
msgstr "调用方独占排空一个物理来源。此方法不初始化、停止、连接唤醒、恢复或以其他方式拥有该来源。读取失败或不一致会使帧及重复帧历史失效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "[inout] Same decoder; callback reentry returns BUSY."
msgstr "[inout] 同一解码器；回调重入返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "[in] Stable exact both-edge source in the config clock epoch."
msgstr "[in] config 时钟纪元内稳定且精确的双边沿来源。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Same feed result, EMPTY or exact port error; no callback is retained."
msgstr "与 feed 结果相同，或为 EMPTY、确切端口错误；不保留回调。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Drop software decode history after the serialized caller joins."
msgstr "串行调用方完成汇合后，清除软件解码历史。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid ""
"Drain/rebind the external source before a new clock epoch is supplied to a "
"reinitialized decoder. Stop does not establish hardware quiescence."
msgstr "为重新初始化的解码器提供新时钟纪元前，须先排空/重新绑定外部来源。Stop 不证明硬件静止。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "[inout] Stable storage with no active feed/poll callback."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定存储，无活动 feed/poll 回调。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/BUSY. No GPIO, EXTI stop or hardware access."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/BUSY。不执行 GPIO、EXTI stop 或硬件访问。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Inclusive authored microsecond limits, not measured tolerances."
msgstr "显式配置的微秒限值（含边界），不是实测容差。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Immutable complete waveform policy, retained through stop."
msgstr "完整且不可变的波形策略，保留至 stop 完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid ""
"All windows are nonzero and at most 20000 us. Zero/one and full/repeat space"
" windows cannot overlap. frame_max_us admits the complete worst permitted "
"32-bit frame plus trailer, at most 1000000 us. Repeat age is bounded by "
"repeat_max_us, at most 5000000 us since the last valid full frame or repeat."
" Input is already demodulated active-low, both edges, in one stable "
"monotonic microsecond epoch. Carrier, receiver fitting, measured accuracy, "
"remote model and product key mapping are external. source_policy defaults to"
" STRICT (zero). IRQ_OBSERVATION explicitly permits COALESCED observations as"
" a software reference; every result remains SAMPLED_UNCERTAIN even when "
"particular inputs are flag-free."
msgstr ""
"所有时间窗口均须非零，且不超过 20000 us。零/一间隔窗口、完整帧/重复帧间隔窗口分别不得重叠。frame_max_us "
"须容纳允许的最坏情况下完整 32 位帧及尾部，且不超过 1000000 us。重复帧时效由 repeat_max_us "
"限制，自上一个有效完整帧或重复帧起不超过 5000000 "
"us。输入已解调、低电平有效，包含双边沿，并处于同一个稳定的单调微秒时钟纪元。载波、接收器实装、实测精度、遥控器型号和产品按键映射由外部负责。source_policy"
" 默认为 STRICT（零）。IRQ_OBSERVATION 明确允许将 COALESCED 观察作为软件参考；即使某些输入未带标志，每个结果仍保持 "
"SAMPLED_UNCERTAIN。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Checked command; timestamp is its final edge or IRQ observation."
msgstr "经检查的命令；时间戳对应其最终边沿或 IRQ 观察。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid ""
"quality and preserved source_flags describe source uncertainty, not physical"
" capture proof. Repeat provenance includes its predecessor. NEC inverse "
"checks cannot establish that an IRQ source lost no edges."
msgstr ""
"quality 和保留的 source_flags 描述来源不确定性，不是物理捕获证明。重复帧的来源记录包括其前序帧。NEC 反码检查无法证明 IRQ "
"来源没有丢失边沿。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Value result; frame is meaningful only with SUCCESS."
msgstr "返回结果值；仅在 SUCCESS 时 frame 才有意义。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid "Caller-owned exact decoder storage, zero before initialization."
msgstr "调用方拥有的精确解码器存储，初始化前须清零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:218
msgid ""
"One serialized task executor. No edge/request/output survives return. Config"
" and any EXTI face/ops/opaque context remain live and disjoint from this "
"owner. Fields are implementation state, not caller controls."
msgstr ""
"单个串行任务执行者。返回后不保留对边沿/请求/输出的引用。配置及所有 EXTI "
"接口/ops/不透明上下文须保持存活，且与此所有者互不重叠。字段属于实现状态，不是调用方控制项。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:222
msgid "tmp117.h"
msgstr "tmp117.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Explicit settled TMP117 one-shot sampling and provenance."
msgstr "显式已结清 TMP117 单次采样与来源信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Validate ID 0117h, locked EEPROM, offset and shutdown."
msgstr "校验标识 0117h、EEPROM 锁定、偏移及 shutdown 状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"No scan, reset, sleep, EEPROM write, worker or Board action. Use a separate "
"cleanup deadline to cancel, or retry init on that same binding. A different "
"binding requires joined software stop; external uncertain-state recovery "
"remains the owner's duty. Failed write is not a device reset."
msgstr ""
"不扫描、复位、sleep、写 EEPROM、创建工作线程或执行 Board 动作。使用独立清理 deadline 执行 cancel，或在相同绑定上重试"
" init。更换绑定需要先 join 并执行软件 stop；外部不确定状态的恢复仍由 owner 负责。写入失败不等同于器件复位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/stopped or same-binding uncertain storage"
msgstr "[inout] 首次清零、已 stop 或同绑定下状态不确定的存储"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[in] Copied on success or uncertain shutdown write"
msgstr "[in] 成功时或已调用 shutdown 写入后状态不确定时复制并保留"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[in] Stable explicit facts, not overlapping device"
msgstr "[in] 稳定的显式事实，不得与 device 重叠"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline, shared across accesses"
msgstr "[in] 所有访问共享的有限绝对 deadline"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY for power-up/EEPROM, or exact transport error; unsupported "
"identity, offset mismatch and unlocked EEPROM reject without writes. Pre-"
"write failure keeps no new binding. Once shutdown write is issued, failure "
"retains the same port/config/clock as uncertain and uninitialized."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、上电或 EEPROM 导致的 BUSY，或原始传输错误；不支持的标识、偏移不符及未锁定 EEPROM 均不执行写入即拒绝。调用 "
"shutdown 写入之前失败不保留新绑定。一旦发出 shutdown 写入，失败将保留相同端口、配置及时钟，实例保持未初始化且状态不确定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Begin one fresh conversion with averaging disabled."
msgstr "禁用平均并开始一次新的转换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"Clears stale readiness before OS admission. BUSY retains conversion metadata"
" only, never a stack/caller buffer. Failure after I/O closes sampling until "
"explicit resync."
msgstr "接纳 OS 请求前清除过期就绪状态。BUSY 仅保留转换元数据，从不保留栈或调用者缓冲区。I/O 后失败将关闭采样，直至显式重新同步。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[inout] Initialized nonmeasuring exclusive device"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、未测量的独占器件"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[in] Finite conversion/read deadline in the same clock"
msgstr "[in] 同一时钟中的有限转换与读取 deadline"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, STATE, TIMEOUT or transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、STATE、TIMEOUT 或传输错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Observe readiness and publish one complete fresh sample."
msgstr "观察就绪状态并发布一个完整的新样本。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"Reads CONFIG clear readiness. A later temperature-read failure is terminal "
"and requires resync, never cached zero or endless ready retry. Any transport"
" error, including BUSY, closes sampling until resync; only a successful not-"
"ready read retains the conversion. Repeated poll after success is STATE. "
"Output is disjoint from device, opaque port/clock context storage and "
"borrowed bus storage; only known spans can be checked. POR/saturation and "
"values outside the reviewed range return IO."
msgstr ""
"读取 CONFIG 会清除就绪标志。随后温度读取失败为终止性失败，必须重新同步，不能变为缓存零值或无限就绪重试。任何传输错误，包括 "
"BUSY，均关闭采样直至重新同步；仅成功读取到未就绪状态才保留转换。成功后再次 poll 返回 STATE。输出不得与 "
"device、不透明端口或时钟上下文存储、借用总线存储重叠；只能检查已知范围。POR、饱和及超出已审查范围的值返回 IO。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[inout] Previously begun conversion, same task executor"
msgstr "[inout] 已开始转换的器件，保持同一任务执行器"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[out] Aligned separate output, unchanged on every error"
msgstr "[out] 对齐且独立的输出；每个错误路径均保持不变"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY before ready, STATE or transport/IO"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、未就绪时的 BUSY、STATE 或传输/IO 错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Request and verify shutdown under a separate cleanup budget."
msgstr "使用独立清理预算请求并核验 shutdown 状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"Cannot preempt a synchronous exchange. Cancel failure never proves physical "
"stop; no MCU span survives a port return. Success does not close a bus owner"
" or join its observers."
msgstr ""
"不能抢占同步交换。取消失败从不证明物理停止；端口返回后不存在 MCU 存储借用。成功也不会关闭 bus owner 或 join 其观察者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[inout] Live or uncertain same binding, serialized owner"
msgstr "[inout] 活跃或状态不确定的同一绑定，由串行 owner 使用"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup deadline, not an expired sample one"
msgstr "[in] 独立的有限清理 deadline，不复用已过期采样 deadline"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after shutdown observation; other results keep recovery "
"responsibility and may require init resync"
msgstr "仅观察到 shutdown 后返回 SUCCESS；其他结果保留恢复责任，可能需要重新 init 同步"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Drop software binding after calls and outer owners join."
msgstr "调用及外层 owner 均 join 后解除软件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"No physical I/O. Not power-off, verified cancellation, Board release or "
"erasure of external uncertain-state duty. A caller requiring physical "
"shutdown first completes cancel or external recovery. Callback-time calls do"
" nothing."
msgstr ""
"不执行物理 I/O，不等同于断电、核验取消、Board 释放，也不消除外部不确定状态责任。需要物理 shutdown 时，调用者应先完成 cancel "
"或外部恢复。回调期间调用不执行任何动作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "[inout] Quiescent instance with no in-progress call"
msgstr "[inout] 不存在进行中调用的静止实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Synchronous register exchange, settled on every return."
msgstr "每次返回均已结清的同步寄存器交换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"Read writes one register byte then repeated-START reads two bytes; write "
"sends register plus two MSB-first bytes. The serialized task owner keeps "
"context and clock alive through use, uncertain cleanup and joined software "
"stop. Every result releases TX/RX spans, including TIMEOUT/CANCELLED. No "
"asynchronous submit or retained stack span is permitted."
msgstr ""
"读取先写一个寄存器字节，再通过重复 START 读取两个字节；写入发送寄存器及两个高字节在前的字节。串行任务 owner 在使用、不确定状态清理及已 "
"join 的软件 stop 期间保持 context 和 clock 有效。每种结果均释放 TX/RX 存储区，包括 "
"TIMEOUT/CANCELLED。不允许异步 submit 或保留栈存储区。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Explicit clock identity and expected existing calibration."
msgstr "显式时钟身份与预期现有校准。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"Nonzero domain/epoch follow nx_io_timestamp_t. The owner changes epoch on "
"discontinuity/reset/rate change. Offset is already applied by the chip; this"
" driver only verifies and reports it, never programs calibration or EEPROM."
msgstr ""
"非零 domain/epoch 遵循 nx_io_timestamp_t。发生不连续、复位或速率变更时，owner 必须变更 "
"epoch。芯片已经应用偏移；本驱动只核对并报告，从不编程校准或 EEPROM。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid "Independent copied sample, published only on SUCCESS."
msgstr "仅 SUCCESS 发布的独立样本副本。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"micro_celsius rounds raw/128 Celsius to nearest microdegree, ties away from "
"zero. raw/offset use 1/128 Celsius per LSB; offset is not added again. "
"Reviewed output is -55..150C. observed is software register-read completion "
"with unknown physical uncertainty, never hardware conversion time. "
"Conversion occurred within [conversion_started_at, observed.ticks] in that "
"same domain/epoch. A consumer can use the lower bound for conservative "
"logical-age checks; recent read completion alone does not establish "
"freshness. All fields are values, with no retained device/payload "
"references. Copies survive stop; clock-domain assumptions still require the "
"caller's continuity/lifetime contract."
msgstr ""
"micro_celsius 将 raw/128 摄氏度舍入至最近微摄氏度，中点远离零。raw/offset 每 LSB 为 1/128 "
"摄氏度，不会再次叠加 offset。已审查输出范围为 -55..150C。observed "
"为软件寄存器读取完成时间，物理不确定度未知，绝非硬件转换时间。转换发生于相同 domain/epoch 的 "
"[conversion_started_at, observed.ticks] "
"之间。消费者可使用下界执行保守的逻辑年龄检查；最近读取完成本身不能确立新鲜度。所有字段均为值，不保留器件或 payload 引用。副本在 stop "
"后仍有效；时钟域假设仍依赖调用者的连续性和生命周期合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:224
msgid ""
"Task-only single executor, no concurrent/reentrant calls. Uncertain physical"
" state retains the port for explicit cancel/resync; it creates no MCU buffer"
" loan. Fields are implementation state, never permission to reclaim a loan."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务中单一执行器，不允许并发或重入调用。不确定物理状态保留端口以供显式 cancel/resync，不产生 MCU "
"缓冲区借用。字段均为内部状态，不能作为回收借用存储的许可。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:228
msgid "tmp117_i2c.h"
msgstr "tmp117_i2c.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:230
msgid "TMP117 transport over an explicit settled I2C endpoint."
msgstr "基于显式已结清 I2C 端点的 TMP117 传输。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:230
msgid "Bind an existing polling endpoint without I/O or discovery."
msgstr "绑定现有轮询端点，不执行 I/O 或设备发现。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:230
msgid ""
"Actual ADD0 wiring/address 48h..4Bh remains external. An async-only endpoint"
" is rejected. No submit fallback borrows stack descriptors. Exactly one "
"serialized bus executor performs exchanges without nested owner queues."
msgstr ""
"实际 ADD0 接线及地址 48h..4Bh 由外部负责。拒绝仅支持异步的端点；没有借用栈描述符的 submit "
"后备路径。仅一个串行总线执行器执行交换，不嵌套 owner 队列。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:230
msgid "[in] Explicit fixed-address face, alive until stop/join"
msgstr "[in] 显式固定地址接口，保持有效直至 stop/join"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:230
msgid "[in] Same live domain as endpoint transaction deadlines"
msgstr "[in] 与端点事务 deadline 相同的活跃时钟域"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:230
msgid "Settled transport, or an invalid zero port for bad methods"
msgstr "已结清传输；方法无效时返回无效零端口"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:234
msgid "bmp280.h"
msgstr "bmp280.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "BMP280 calibration and explicit forced-conversion driver."
msgstr "BMP280 校准与显式强制转换驱动。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Parse the exact 24-byte little-endian calibration block."
msgstr "解析准确的 24 字节小端校准块。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[in] Register block beginning at 0x88"
msgstr "[in] 从 0x88 开始的寄存器块"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[in] Must be exactly 24"
msgstr "[in] 必须恰为 24"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[out] Written only on success"
msgstr "[out] 仅成功时写入"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID for length/zero pressure divisor"
msgstr "SUCCESS；长度错误或压力除数为零时为 INVALID"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Compensate one raw sample using checked integer arithmetic."
msgstr "使用经过检查的整数运算补偿一个原始样本。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[in] Parsed calibration"
msgstr "[in] 已解析的校准数据"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[in] Unsigned 20-bit ADC value"
msgstr "[in] 无符号 20 位 ADC 值"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed/overflow calibration or IO for disabled ADC "
"sentinel/out-of-datasheet-range physical output"
msgstr "SUCCESS；校准格式错误或溢出时为 INVALID；ADC 禁用哨兵值或物理输出超出数据手册范围时为 IO"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Validate chip ID and load calibration, without scanning."
msgstr "验证芯片 ID 并加载校准，不扫描设备。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid ""
"Task context; failure leaves initialized false and no borrow. Does not soft-"
"reset the part or create a wait loop/task. Retry BUSY explicitly."
msgstr ""
"任务上下文；失败时 initialized 保持 false，且无借用。不软复位器件，也不创建等待循环或任务。BUSY 必须由调用者显式重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[out] Zero-initialized unused instance"
msgstr "[out] 零初始化且尚未使用的实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[in] Synchronous settled port and live monotonic clock"
msgstr "[in] 调用返回前已结清的同步接口，以及有效的单调时钟"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline for all initialization accesses"
msgstr "[in] 覆盖全部初始化访问的绝对截止时间"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for NVM update, or transport/identity error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；NVM 更新期间为 BUSY；也可能返回传输或身份错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Start one forced temperature/pressure conversion."
msgstr "启动一次强制温度／压力转换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid ""
"Task-only serialized driver owner; oversampling x1/x1. Ready time is finite "
"even with an explicit infinite caller deadline. EXHAUSTED retains no "
"software conversion or MCU buffer; a completed configuration write can still"
" have started the sensor. Retry uses its actual idle status."
msgstr ""
"仅由串行 Task 驱动 owner 调用，过采样 x1／x1。即使调用方显式选择无限 deadline，ready 等待仍有限。EXHAUSTED "
"不保留软件转换状态或 MCU buffer；已经完成的配置写入仍可能启动传感器。重试须观察其实际 idle 状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[inout] Initialized non-measuring instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未在测量的实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline covering conversion and reads"
msgstr "[in] 覆盖转换与读取的绝对截止时间"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, TIMEOUT, EXHAUSTED or transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、TIMEOUT、EXHAUSTED 或传输错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Poll conversion without an implicit worker or blocking delay."
msgstr "轮询转换，不使用隐式执行任务或阻塞延迟。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid ""
"Task-only. Every port call releases temporary buffers before return. BUSY "
"retains device conversion state, never stack or caller buffers. After "
"terminal failure, begin may retry; the external owner chooses policy."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文。每次接口调用在返回前释放临时缓冲。BUSY 保留器件转换状态，不保留栈或调用者缓冲。终止失败后可再次 begin；策略由外部所有者选择。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[inout] Instance with a previously started conversion"
msgstr "[inout] 已启动过转换的实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[out] Written only on SUCCESS"
msgstr "[out] 仅在 SUCCESS 时写入"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY while converting, TIMEOUT or transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；转换期间为 BUSY；也可能返回 TIMEOUT 或传输错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Stop software use after all synchronous calls have exited."
msgstr "全部同步调用退出后停止软件使用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid ""
"Does not power off or reset a physical part. Sensor-internal conversion can "
"finish without accessing MCU storage. No MCU borrow remains."
msgstr "不为物理器件断电或复位。传感器内部转换可在不访问 MCU 存储的情况下完成。不再存在 MCU 借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "[inout] Quiesced driver instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已静默的驱动实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Synchronous settled SPI transaction port."
msgstr "同步、已结清的 SPI 事务端口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid ""
"exchange always releases every TX/RX buffer before returning, including "
"TIMEOUT/error. One CS interval covers all bytes; mode 0 or 3, 8-bit words, "
"<=10 MHz. Caller serializes this device and its bus owner. Driver stack "
"transactions never cross asynchronous borrowing boundaries."
msgstr ""
"exchange 始终在返回前释放全部 TX/RX 缓冲，包括 TIMEOUT 或错误路径。一个 CS 区间覆盖全部字节；采用模式 0 或 3、8 "
"位字、频率不超过 10 MHz。调用者串行使用该器件及其总线所有者。驱动的栈上事务不会跨越异步借用边界。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Register calibration, owned by one device instance."
msgstr "由一个设备实例拥有的寄存器校准数据。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Output is valid only on successful conversion/compensation."
msgstr "仅成功转换／补偿时输出有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:236
msgid "Explicit device context, no Board pins or automatic sampling task."
msgstr "显式设备上下文，不含 Board 引脚或自动采样任务。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:240
msgid "bmp280_spi.h"
msgstr "bmp280_spi.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:242
msgid "Optional BMP280 adapter over a fixed SPI endpoint."
msgstr "固定 SPI 端点上的可选 BMP280 适配器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:242
msgid "Bind a real polling SPI endpoint as settled transport."
msgstr "绑定真实轮询 SPI 端点作为能结清的传输端口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:242
msgid "[in] Fixed endpoint kept alive throughout device use"
msgstr "[in] 在器件使用期间始终保持有效的固定端点"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:242
msgid "[in] Same monotonic domain as IO transfer deadlines"
msgstr "[in] 与 I/O 传输截止时间相同的单调时钟域"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:242
msgid "Narrow transport; no global discovery or CS selection"
msgstr "窄传输接口；不进行全局发现或 CS 选择"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:246
msgid "dp83848.h"
msgstr "dp83848.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Explicit DP83848 identity, reset and observed link mechanism."
msgstr "显式 DP83848 身份、复位与链路观察机制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Read exact supported identity; mismatch never becomes a default PHY."
msgstr "读取准确支持的身份；不匹配时绝不改用默认 PHY。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "[inout] Explicit MDIO face, address and expected supported model."
msgstr "[inout] 显式的 MDIO 接口、地址及预期支持的型号。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "[in] Finite absolute MDIO clock deadline."
msgstr "[in] MDIO 时钟域中的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Success, UNSUPPORTED for identity mismatch, or MDIO error."
msgstr "成功；身份不符时为 UNSUPPORTED；或 MDIO 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Bounded BMCR soft reset and observed self-clearing acknowledgement."
msgstr "有界 BMCR 软件复位，并观察自清除确认。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid ""
"Task-only finite absolute deadline; reset restraps the device and clears "
"configured truth. This is not a GPIO, power or strap proof."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，使用有限绝对截止时间；复位会重新采样器件 strap，并清除已配置事实。这不证明 GPIO、电源或 strap 正确。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "[inout] Proved identity and caller-owned component state."
msgstr "[inout] 已证明的身份及调用者拥有的组件状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Success after real reset acknowledgement, or state/MDIO error."
msgstr "真实复位得到确认后成功；否则返回状态或 MDIO 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Start explicit negotiation or fixed mode, never wait for fake link."
msgstr "启动显式协商或固定模式，不等待伪造链路。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid ""
"Task-only; identity must be proved. SUCCESS means registers configured, not "
"autonegotiation complete. Failures retain configured=false."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文；必须已证明身份。SUCCESS 表示寄存器已配置，不表示自协商已完成。失败时 configured 保持 false。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "[inout] Proved identity, kept live through operations."
msgstr "[inout] 已证明的身份，操作期间持续保持有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "[in] Explicit fixed mode or negotiation advertisement."
msgstr "[in] 显式的固定模式或协商通告。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Success means configured registers; otherwise no configured truth."
msgstr "成功表示寄存器已配置；其他结果不建立已配置事实。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Observe latch-low BMSR twice and DP83848 PHYSTS speed/duplex truth."
msgstr "对锁存低电平 BMSR 读取两次，并观察 DP83848 PHYSTS 的真实速率／双工状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid ""
"Task-only; output changes only on SUCCESS. up requires actual link and "
"complete autonegotiation when selected. Protocol or remote fault does not "
"invent speed/link. MAC application remains an external action."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文；只在 SUCCESS 时改变输出。up 要求真实链路有效，且选用自协商时必须完成自协商。协议或远端故障不能虚构速率或链路状态。向 MAC"
" 应用该状态仍是外部动作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "[inout] Probed and configured caller-owned component."
msgstr "[inout] 已探测并配置、由调用者拥有的组件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "[out] Observed value, separate from component storage."
msgstr "[out] 观察值，必须与组件存储分离。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "Success copies observed link; other results preserve output."
msgstr "成功时复制观察到的链路；其他结果保持输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid "External policy explicitly selects autonegotiation or fixed mode."
msgstr "外部策略显式选择自动协商或固定模式。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid ""
"Caller-owned PHY state; no board address, reset GPIO or worker default."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 PHY 状态；不提供默认板级地址、reset GPIO 或执行任务。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:248
msgid ""
"expected_id selects TI or NS model, ignoring revision nibble only. One task "
"owner serializes this component and the shared MDIO port."
msgstr "expected_id 选择 TI 或 NS 型号，仅忽略修订号的四位字段。由一个任务所有者串行使用该组件及共享 MDIO 接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:252
msgid "sfud.h"
msgstr "sfud.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Selected SFUD NOR algorithms behind the existing SPI owner."
msgstr "已有 SPI owner 后的选定 SFUD NOR 算法。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid ""
"Author  Nexus Team   Version  1.0.0   Date  2026-11-21   Copyright  "
"Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr ""
