"Team"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "1.0.0"
msgstr "1.0.0"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "2026-11-21"
msgstr "2026-11-21"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr "Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Explicit suffix selection; JEDEC alone does not prove this model."
msgstr "显式后缀选择；仅 JEDEC 不能证明该型号。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Exact workspace bytes for the selected static chip profile."
msgstr "选定静态芯片 profile 的精确 workspace 字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Required workspace alignment, without allocation."
msgstr "所需 workspace 对齐，不执行分配。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid ""
"Admit one explicitly selected awake W25Q128JV using only read commands."
msgstr "仅用读命令准入一个显式选定且已唤醒的 W25Q128JV。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid ""
"Calls selected upstream read/program/erase algorithms after explicit "
"metadata admission, not SFUD's reset-capable device_init/discovery. No "
"concurrent W25/SFUD owner may command this same physical chip."
msgstr ""
"显式 metadata 准入后调用选定上游 read／program／erase 算法，不使用 SFUD 可 reset 的 "
"device_init／discovery。不得由并行 W25／SFUD owner 向同一物理芯片发命令。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[out] Unused caller metadata; retained through proven stop."
msgstr "[out] 未使用的调用者 metadata；保留到 stop 已被证明成功。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Existing single-line mode 0/3 SPI owner, at most 50 MHz."
msgstr "[in] 已有单线 mode 0/3 SPI owner，最高 50 MHz。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Ready monotonic clock in the same deadline domain."
msgstr "[in] 同一 deadline 域内已就绪的单调 clock。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Exact product-selected model, not autodetection policy."
msgstr "[in] 产品精确选定的型号，不是自动探测策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Actual power-up/write readiness established externally."
msgstr "[in] 由外部建立的真实 power-up／write readiness。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[inout] Disjoint aligned caller vendor-state storage."
msgstr "[inout] 独立、对齐的调用者 vendor-state 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] At least the exact reported requirement."
msgstr "[in] 至少达到所报告的精确要求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Finite absolute probe deadline."
msgstr "[in] 有限绝对 probe deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "SUCCESS or error; no reset, status write, protection change or erase."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；不执行 reset、status write、保护变更或 erase。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid ""
"Query the full physical 16 MiB array; products supply their own region."
msgstr "查询完整物理 16 MiB array；region 由产品提供。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "The current profile is non-ECC NOR, one-byte program and 4 KiB erase."
msgstr "当前 profile 为 non-ECC NOR，编程粒度为 1 字节，擦除粒度为 4 KiB。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Initialized serialized owner, stable through all users."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化、串行管理的 owner，在所有使用者存活期间保持稳定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Existing immutable face or NULL; lookup does not initialize hardware."
msgstr "已有不可变 face 或 NULL；lookup 不初始化硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Set the next explicit synchronous read budget without any bus access."
msgstr "不访问 bus，设置下一次显式同步 read 预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid ""
"Set once before the whole FAL/DB/filesystem operation, never per read. No "
"timeout renewal or hidden current-deadline variable is created."
msgstr ""
"在整次 FAL／DB／filesystem 操作前只设一次，不为每次 read 重设。不续期 timeout，也不创建隐藏的 current-"
"deadline 变量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle instance, externally serialized."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的空闲实例，由外部串行化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Finite provider-domain budget, shared with its consumer."
msgstr "[in] provider 域内与 consumer 共用的有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE, INVALID or TIMEOUT without hardware effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE、INVALID 或 TIMEOUT；无硬件效果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Perform bounded cleanup without resetting or replaying failed writes."
msgstr "执行有界 cleanup，不 reset，也不 replay 失败写入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid ""
"Cleanup never upgrades a previous write result. Call before the Flash face's"
" non-I/O recover observation; preserve storage while BUSY."
msgstr "cleanup 不升级先前写入结果。在 Flash face 的非 I/O recover 观测前调用；BUSY 期间保留存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[inout] Same owner retained after timeout or uncertain command."
msgstr "[inout] timeout 或不确定命令后仍保留的同一 owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[in] Fresh finite budget for at most four probes."
msgstr "[in] 至多四次 probe 的新有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "SUCCESS after WIP0/SUS0/WEL0, BUSY or a retained error otherwise."
msgstr "WIP0／SUS0／WEL0 后返回 SUCCESS，否则为 BUSY 或保留的错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Unbind only after every user joined and the chip proved quiescent."
msgstr "只有所有使用者已退出会合，且已证明芯片没有在途操作时，才可解绑。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "[inout] Stable serialized state, live through refused stop."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定串行状态，被拒绝 stop 时仍存活。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY; does not stop/reset the existing SPI bus owner."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY；不 stop／reset 已有 SPI bus owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:254
msgid "Caller metadata; workspace contains all private upstream state."
msgstr "调用者 metadata；workspace 保存全部私有上游状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:258
msgid "as5047p.h"
msgstr "as5047p.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Selected read-only AS5047P angle and explicit error clearing."
msgstr "选定的只读 AS5047P 角度接口与显式错误清除。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Check factory/selected settings and ready diagnostics without writes."
msgstr "不执行写入，检查出厂／选定设置与就绪诊断。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid ""
"Task-only; no heap/worker/locks. No unique chip identity is available in "
"this profile. Successful reads do not prove physical part fitting. Failed "
"I/O retains this binding for explicit clear/reinit or stop. No OTP, zero-"
"position, reset or settings writes are performed."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文；无堆、worker 或锁。此 profile 不提供唯一芯片身份。读取成功不证明物理料号实装正确。I/O 失败保留该绑定，供显式 "
"clear/reinit 或 stop 使用。不执行 OTP、零位、复位或设置写入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/stopped or same-binding inactive state."
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化／已停止状态，或同一绑定的非活动状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[in] Stable aligned binding, disjoint from device and endpoint."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且对齐的绑定，与 device 和 endpoint 存储分离。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[in] Finite absolute budget for all frames."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖全部帧的有限绝对预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for offset loops, or checked protocol/transport error."
msgstr "SUCCESS，偏移补偿循环未就绪时为 BUSY，或已检查的协议／transport 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Read diagnostics and the reply to this call's own angle command."
msgstr "读取诊断，以及本次调用自身角度命令的应答。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid ""
"First-frame replies belong to an older command and are discarded. Current "
"replies require even parity and EF=0; CORDIC overflow rejects. No temporary "
"buffer is retained after any endpoint return. Protocol or transport failure "
"closes reads until explicit clear/reinitialization. Config, endpoint, opaque"
" contexts and output storage stay disjoint."
msgstr ""
"首帧应答属于旧命令，会被丢弃。当前应答必须通过偶校验且 EF=0；CORDIC 溢出会被拒绝。任何 endpoint 调用返回后均不保留临时 "
"buffer。协议或 transport 失败会关闭读取，直至显式清除／重新初始化。配置、endpoint、不透明 context 与输出存储互不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized task owner and live binding."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、在同一任务内串行执行的 owner，以及有效绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned output, unchanged on every error."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出；任何错误均保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[in] One finite budget for both two-frame register reads."
msgstr "[in] 两次双帧寄存器读取共用的有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for unready diagnostics, or checked error."
msgstr "SUCCESS，诊断未就绪时为 BUSY，或已检查的错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Explicitly read/clear ERRFL, then verify no remaining error flags."
msgstr "显式读取／清除 ERRFL，再核验没有剩余错误标志。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid ""
"Read-to-clear is an acknowledged device effect even if this call fails. It "
"is not bus recovery. Success requires fresh init before samples resume; no "
"automatic error clearing or measurement replay."
msgstr "即使本次调用失败，读清除也可能已经产生器件效果。这不属于总线恢复。成功后仍需重新初始化才能恢复采样；不会自动清除错误或重放测量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[inout] Bound same-task state, including failed initialization."
msgstr "[inout] 同一任务中的已绑定状态，包括初始化失败的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned original PARERR/INVCOMM/FRERR bits."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的原始 PARERR/INVCOMM/FRERR 位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[in] Separate finite cleanup budget for both register reads."
msgstr "[in] 两次寄存器读取使用的独立有限清理预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "SUCCESS or checked error; flags is unchanged on failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或已检查的错误；失败保持 flags 不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Drop the software binding after every consumer has joined."
msgstr "全部消费者完成退出会合后，解除软件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid ""
"No I/O, bus-owner release or physical power-down. External SPI/CS recovery "
"responsibility survives this software stop."
msgstr "不执行 I/O、释放总线 owner 或关闭物理电源。该软件 stop 后，外部仍承担 SPI/CS 恢复责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "[inout] Same serialized task state, with no executing call."
msgstr "[inout] 同一任务中的串行状态，且没有正在执行的调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or BUSY while a callback is active."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或回调活动期间的 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Immutable explicit sensor binding, retained through software stop."
msgstr "明确且不可变的传感器绑定，保留至软件 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid ""
"Endpoint is settled polling SPI mode 1, MSB-first, <=10 MHz, with >=350 ns "
"CS setup/high and datasheet hold timing. The binding owner proves those "
"electrical facts; an ordinary endpoint does not assert them. No IRQ/async "
"fallback or implicit delay is added. This instance and all frames to this "
"sensor share one serialized task executor. Nonzero domain/epoch describe the"
" supplied microsecond clock. External reset/clock discontinuity requires "
"explicit stop and reinitialization."
msgstr ""
"端点为返回时已结清的 polling SPI mode 1、MSB-first、<=10 MHz，并满足 >=350 ns 的 CS "
"建立／高电平时间及数据手册的保持时间。绑定 owner 负责证明这些电气事实；普通 endpoint 不声明它们。组件不增加 IRQ/async "
"回退或隐式延时。本实例和发往该传感器的全部帧共用一个串行任务执行者。非零 domain/epoch 描述所提供的微秒时钟。外部复位／时钟不连续后需显式 "
"stop 并重新初始化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Copied 14-bit modulo angle with a separate diagnostic observation."
msgstr "复制的 14 位模数角度，以及独立的诊断观察。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid ""
"Angle counts have 16384 positions/revolution; no mechanical zero, direction,"
" unwrapping or speed policy is inferred. Diagnostics retain MAGH/MAGL "
"warnings. Their read precedes the angle and is not an atomic physical "
"snapshot. observed is software angle-read completion with unknown "
"aperture/physical uncertainty, not a shaft-edge timestamp."
msgstr ""
"角度计数每圈有 16384 个位置；不推断机械零位、方向、展开或速度策略。诊断保留 MAGH/MAGL "
"警告，其读取先于角度读取，不构成原子的物理快照。observed 是软件角度读取完成时间，采样孔径／物理不确定度未知，不是轴边沿时间戳。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:260
msgid "Zero-initialized caller storage; fields are private implementation."
msgstr "调用者提供的零初始化存储；字段属于私有实现。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:264
msgid "ina226.h"
msgstr "ina226.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Exact INA226 triggered monitoring with explicit calibration."
msgstr "带明确标定参数的精确 INA226 触发式监测。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Compute floor(5120000000000 / (shunt_uohm * current_lsb_nA))."
msgstr "计算 floor(5120000000000 / (shunt_uohm * current_lsb_nA))。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Pure task/IRQ arithmetic; no device access, heap, time or retention."
msgstr "可在任务／IRQ 使用的纯算术运算；不访问设备、堆、时钟，也不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[in] Positive physical resistor scale."
msgstr "[in] 为正的物理电阻尺度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[in] Positive chosen current unit."
msgstr "[in] 为正的选定电流单位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned 1..32767 result on SUCCESS only."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的结果，仅 SUCCESS 时发布，范围 1..32767。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED outside the calibration range."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或超出标定范围时的 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Verify identity, configure shutdown, and program/read back scaling."
msgstr "核验身份，配置 shutdown，并写入／回读尺度参数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid ""
"Task-only; no scan, reset, worker, heap or implicit wait. Manufacturer 5449h"
" and die 2260h/2261h are accepted, not unique identity proof. Existing ALERT"
" controls reject before writes. Once any configuration write is issued, "
"failure retains this binding as uncertain; shutdown with a separate cleanup "
"budget is required before stop/rebinding."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文；不扫描、复位、创建 worker、分配堆或隐式等待。接纳 manufacturer 5449h 和 die "
"2260h/2261h，但这些不证明唯一身份。已有 ALERT "
"控制会在写入前拒绝。任何配置写入一旦发出，失败就保留不确定的绑定；stop／重新绑定前必须在独立清理预算下执行 shutdown。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[in] Stable disjoint hardware/scale facts, retained until stop."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、存储分离的硬件／尺度事实，保留至 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[in] Finite absolute budget for the full initialization."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖完整初始化的有限绝对预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "SUCCESS or exact validation/identity/transport/time error."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或具体的校验／身份／transport／时间错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Trigger one shunt+bus conversion using the verified calibration."
msgstr "使用已核验的标定触发一次分流＋总线转换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid ""
"Configuration write clears stale conversion-ready. No busy wait or data "
"buffer is retained. Uncertain issued writes require shutdown."
msgstr ""
"配置写入清除旧的 conversion-ready 状态。不忙等，也不保留数据 buffer。已发出写入的不确定状态必须执行 shutdown。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[inout] Initialized nonmeasuring serialized task state."
msgstr "[inout] 同一任务内已初始化、未在测量的串行状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[in] Finite budget including later poll/read operations."
msgstr "[in] 包含后续 poll/read 操作的有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE, TIMEOUT or checked transport error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE、TIMEOUT，或已检查的 transport 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Poll readiness and consume one complete one-shot measurement."
msgstr "轮询就绪状态并消费一份完整的单次测量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid ""
"CVRF is read-to-clear; a failure after readiness cannot retry that sample. "
"OVF, reset/calibration drift, short I2C progress and impossible bus range "
"close sampling until shutdown/reinit. Every endpoint return ends temporary "
"buffer borrowing, including errors and timeout."
msgstr ""
"CVRF 为读清除；观察到就绪后若失败，不能重试该样本。OVF、复位／标定漂移、I2C 进度不足或不可能的总线量程均会关闭采样，直至 "
"shutdown/reinit。每次 endpoint 返回都会结束临时 buffer 借用，包括错误和超时。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[inout] Same task owner after a successful begin."
msgstr "[inout] begin 成功后的同一任务 owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY before ready, STATE or checked error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、就绪前的 BUSY、STATE，或已检查的错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Write and verify shutdown under a separate cleanup deadline."
msgstr "使用独立清理 deadline 写入并核验 shutdown。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid ""
"No reset or owner release. Success retires the conversion and requires fresh"
" initialization before another begin; no borrowed MCU span exists."
msgstr "不复位或释放 owner。成功后结束本次转换，下次 begin 前需重新初始化；不存在被借用的 MCU 存储区。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[inout] Live or uncertain same-binding serialized state."
msgstr "[inout] 有效或不确定的同一绑定串行状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup budget in the original clock epoch."
msgstr "[in] 原始 clock epoch 内的有限清理预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "SUCCESS only after shutdown readback; failures retain uncertainty."
msgstr "仅 shutdown 回读成立后返回 SUCCESS；失败保留不确定性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Drop a quiescent software binding after its users have joined."
msgstr "用户完成退出会合后，解除已静默的软件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "No I/O or I2C owner release. Complete shutdown first when required."
msgstr "不执行 I/O 或释放 I2C owner。需要时先完成 shutdown。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "[inout] Same-task inactive, certain caller state."
msgstr "[inout] 同一任务内非活动、状态确定的调用者存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY during a call, or STATE with live/uncertain conversion."
msgstr "SUCCESS；调用期间为 BUSY；转换仍活动／不确定时为 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Explicit hardware scale and selected single-shot conversion profile."
msgstr "明确的硬件尺度与选定单次转换 profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid ""
"I2C is a settled polling endpoint for the actual 40h..4Fh wiring. One task "
"serializes this device, bus and all register accesses. The component owns "
"conversion/configuration/calibration, with no external ALERT owner. "
"Averaging and both conversion-time codes are 0..7 as defined by INA226. "
"Domain/epoch describe the same live microsecond clock as I2C deadlines. "
"Shunt/current units determine a truncated 15-bit calibration; the product "
"owns tolerance and physical limits. This low-rate monitor is not a motor "
"phase-current sampler."
msgstr ""
"I2C 为实际 40h..4Fh 接线对应、返回时已结清的 polling "
"endpoint。同一任务串行访问器件、总线和全部寄存器。组件拥有转换／配置／标定职责，不允许外部 ALERT "
"owner。平均次数与两种转换时间编码均为 INA226 规定的 0..7。domain/epoch 描述与 I2C deadline "
"相同且有效的微秒时钟。分流电阻／电流单位决定截断后的 15 位标定值；容差和物理限制由产品负责。此低速监测器不是电机相电流采样器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Complete copied one-shot results, published only on success."
msgstr "完整复制的单次结果，仅在成功时发布。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid ""
"Current is signed; power is the unsigned device power result. Bus and shunt "
"conversions are sequential, not simultaneous. observed is software read "
"completion, with unknown physical/aperture uncertainty. The complete "
"conversion was triggered no earlier than started_at. Integer scaling uses "
"the requested current LSB; calibration truncation, shunt tolerance and "
"analog error remain explicit product error terms."
msgstr ""
"电流有符号；功率是器件返回的无符号功率结果。总线与分流转换依次进行，不同时发生。observed "
"是软件读取完成时间，物理／采样孔径不确定度未知。完整转换的触发不早于 started_at。整数换算使用请求的 current "
"LSB；标定截断、分流电阻容差和模拟误差仍是产品需明确处理的误差项。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:266
msgid "Fresh zero caller state; bindings remain live through recovery."
msgstr "调用者提供的新零初始化状态；绑定在恢复期间保持有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:270
msgid "lsm6dsox.h"
msgstr "lsm6dsox.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Explicit settled LSM6DSOX six-axis and tagged FIFO profile."
msgstr "明确且返回时已结清的 LSM6DSOX 六轴与带标签 FIFO profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Fixed 104 Hz, +/-4 g and +/-500 deg/s profile; paths are exclusive."
msgstr "固定 104 Hz、+/-4 g 和 +/-500 deg/s profile；路径互斥。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "One uncompressed FIFO tag; timestamp entries are not vector pairs."
msgstr "一个未压缩 FIFO 标签；时间戳条目不表示向量配对。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Validate identity 6Ch and bind without configuration writes."
msgstr "核验身份 6Ch 并绑定，不写入配置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Caller supplies power-up readiness and exclusive device ownership. Unknown "
"identity retains no binding. No probing, reset, calibration, sleep or hidden"
" task."
msgstr "调用者提供上电就绪条件和独占器件所有权。未知身份不保留绑定。不探测、复位、标定、sleep 或创建隐藏任务。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Fresh zeroed, exclusive caller storage."
msgstr "[inout] 调用者独占的新零初始化存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] Settled callbacks, copied only on success."
msgstr "[in] 返回时已结清的回调，仅成功时复制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] Separate immutable explicit clock/mode facts."
msgstr "[in] 独立、不可变且明确的时钟／模式事实。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] Finite absolute whole-operation deadline."
msgstr "[in] 整个操作使用的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, UNSUPPORTED or transport error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、UNSUPPORTED，或 transport 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Explicitly request destructive volatile software reset."
msgstr "显式请求会清除易失状态的软件复位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Not reset completion or analog readiness. Reset discards prior FIFO and "
"configuration. No automatic reset retry."
msgstr "这不表示复位完成或模拟部分就绪。复位丢弃原有 FIFO 和配置，不会自动重试复位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Initialized stopped instance, same task owner."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且已停止的实例，由同一任务 owner 使用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] Fixed finite budget including later reset polls."
msgstr "[in] 固定有限预算，包含后续 reset 轮询。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "SUCCESS starts reset; failure can retain uncertainty."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示已启动 reset；失败可能保留不确定性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Observe the pending reset under its original deadline."
msgstr "使用原始 deadline 观察尚未完成的 reset。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Completion advances generation and clears sequence. No wait or renewed "
"deadline; caller explicitly schedules polls."
msgstr "完成后推进 generation 并清除 sequence。不等待或延长 deadline；调用者显式安排轮询。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Same instance and serialized task executor."
msgstr "[inout] 同一实例与串行任务执行者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "SUCCESS after reset clears, BUSY, or retained error."
msgstr "reset 清除后为 SUCCESS，也可能为 BUSY 或需保留处理责任的错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Configure and verify the exact selected measurement profile."
msgstr "配置并核验精确选定的测量 profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Enables BDU/autoincrement and selected 104 Hz outputs. FIFO selects "
"uncompressed stream plus timestamp entries. Success is configuration, not "
"settled analog accuracy. The product observes startup/thermal/electrical "
"qualification separately."
msgstr ""
"启用 BDU／自动递增和选定的 104 Hz 输出。FIFO "
"选择未压缩流及时间戳条目。成功表示配置完成，不证明模拟精度已经稳定。产品单独验证启动、热状态与电气条件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Verified reset-complete instance."
msgstr "[inout] 已核验 reset 完成的实例。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] Finite budget shared by configuration/readback."
msgstr "[in] 配置／回读共用的有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "SUCCESS or error retaining physical cleanup responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或保留物理清理责任的错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Copy one direct observation when both outputs are ready."
msgstr "两个输出均就绪后，复制一次直接观察。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Transport failure closes publication; explicit stop/reset is required. No "
"cached zero or automatic replay is returned."
msgstr "transport 失败关闭发布，需要显式 stop/reset。不返回缓存的零值，也不自动重放。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Running DIRECT profile on the same task owner."
msgstr "[inout] 同一任务 owner 中正在运行的 DIRECT profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[out] Separate aligned output, unchanged on any error."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出；任何错误均保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] One finite budget across both reads."
msgstr "[in] 两次读取共用的有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE, EXHAUSTED or transport error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE、EXHAUSTED，或 transport 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Pop one selected FIFO record with overflow observation."
msgstr "弹出一个选定的 FIFO 记录，并观察溢出。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Output bytes are copied, never borrowed. Sensor overrun or a failure after a"
" FIFO pop can lose records; both close publication. Consumer owns pairing "
"and rate/age assumptions."
msgstr ""
"输出字节采用复制语义，不产生借用。传感器 overrun 或 FIFO "
"弹出后的失败可能丢失记录，两者都会关闭发布。消费者负责配对及采样率／样本年龄假设。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Running TAGGED_FIFO profile, same executor."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者中运行的 TAGGED_FIFO profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[out] Separate aligned output, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出；失败保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] Finite whole-operation budget."
msgstr "[in] 整个操作的有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, OVERFLOW, UNSUPPORTED or retained error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、OVERFLOW、UNSUPPORTED，或需保留处理责任的错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Disable both ODRs, discard FIFO and verify withdrawal."
msgstr "关闭两个 ODR，丢弃 FIFO 并核验源已撤回。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"No bus shutdown or power-off. In-progress reset returns BUSY. Restart "
"requires a new explicit verified reset."
msgstr "不关闭总线或电源。reset 仍在进行时返回 BUSY。重启前需完成一次新的显式、经核验的 reset。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Initialized or uncertain same binding."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化或不确定的同一绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[in] Independent finite cleanup budget."
msgstr "[in] 独立的有限清理预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "SUCCESS only after OFF/BYPASS readback; error keeps duty."
msgstr "仅 OFF/BYPASS 回读成立后返回 SUCCESS；错误保留恢复责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Drop software binding after every caller has joined."
msgstr "全部调用者完成退出会合后，解除软件绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"No I/O and no action during callback reentrancy. This never proves physical "
"stop: complete stop or externally recover the device first, or retain that "
"external responsibility. Rebinding requires a new external session identity."
msgstr ""
"不执行 I/O，回调重入时也不执行操作。这不能证明物理停止：应先完成 stop 或从外部恢复器件，或继续保留外部恢复责任。重新绑定需要新的外部会话身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "[inout] Quiescent caller-owned instance."
msgstr "[inout] 调用者拥有且已静默的实例。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Settled register callbacks; every return releases all payload spans."
msgstr "返回时已结清的寄存器回调；任何返回都会释放全部 payload 存储区。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"One serialized task owns device and bus access. SUCCESS transfers all "
"requested bytes; no callback may retain local arrays. Ports and opaque "
"context storage outlive calls and any uncertain physical recovery. No "
"asynchronous fallback or hidden executor is permitted."
msgstr ""
"一个串行任务拥有器件和总线访问。SUCCESS 表示传输了全部请求字节；回调不得保留局部数组。端口与不透明 context "
"存储的寿命覆盖全部调用，以及任何不确定的物理恢复过程。不允许异步回退或隐藏执行者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Caller proves live clock continuity; no automatic epoch detection."
msgstr "调用者证明有效时钟的连续性；不会自动检测 epoch。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Copied six-axis observation in the sensor's native right-hand axes."
msgstr "按传感器原生右手坐标轴复制的六轴观察。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Both data-ready bits were observed before two separate BDU reads. This does "
"not establish coincident apertures or a lossless stream. observed is "
"software read completion, with unknown physical error. Sequence advances "
"only on publication. Generation changes on verified reset. Neither value is "
"a persistent identity across release/rebind. Calibration, mounting rotation "
"and sample-age policy stay external."
msgstr ""
"两次独立 BDU 读取前已观察到两个 data-ready 位。这不证明采样孔径同时发生或数据流无丢失。observed "
"是软件读取完成时间，物理误差未知。sequence 只在发布时推进，generation 在核验 reset 后变化。两者都不是跨 "
"release/rebind 持久保存的身份。标定、安装旋转和样本年龄策略由外部负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "One copied FIFO record with independent tag and publication sequence."
msgstr "一个复制的 FIFO 记录，带独立 tag 和发布 sequence。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Vector tags have raw signed counts and SI values (m/s^2 or rad/s). Timestamp"
" tags have only sensor_ticks: native wrapping 32-bit ticks, nominally 25 us "
"each. No wrap extension, pairing or synchronization to observed is implied. "
"FIFO overflow closes publication until explicit stop/reset/start; "
"unsupported tags also require resynchronization."
msgstr ""
"向量 tag 包含原始有符号计数及 SI 值（m/s^2 或 rad/s）。时间戳 tag 只有 sensor_ticks：原生会回绕的 32 位 "
"tick，名义上每 tick 为 25 us。不隐含回绕扩展、配对或与 observed 同步。FIFO 溢出会关闭发布，直至显式 "
"stop/reset/start；未支持的 tag 也要求重新同步。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid "Caller-owned zeroed instance; fields are private implementation state."
msgstr "调用者拥有的零初始化实例；字段属于私有实现状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:272
msgid ""
"Task-only, no concurrent/reentrant calls. Uncertain state retains the "
"binding and recovery duty, but settled ports retain no MCU payload loan. A "
"time fault cannot be repaired by a numerically later deadline."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文，禁止并发／重入。不确定状态保留绑定和恢复责任，但返回时已结清的端口不保留 MCU payload 借用。数值更大的 deadline "
"不能修复时间故障。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:276
msgid "lsm6dsox_i2c.h"
msgstr "lsm6dsox_i2c.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:278
msgid "LSM6DSOX over one settled fixed-address I2C endpoint."
msgstr "通过一个返回时已结清、地址固定的 I2C endpoint 接入 LSM6DSOX。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:278
msgid "Bind an existing settled endpoint without bus access."
msgstr "绑定已有且返回时已结清的 endpoint，不访问总线。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:278
msgid ""
"Address straps/electrical facts stay external. Repeated START is required; "
"no async fallback borrows stack arrays."
msgstr "地址绑带／电气事实由外部负责。要求 repeated START；不会通过 async 回退借用栈数组。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:278
msgid "[in] Stable polling endpoint, address 6Ah or 6Bh."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的 polling endpoint，地址为 6Ah 或 6Bh。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:278
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:284
msgid "[in] Same live monotonic domain as transaction deadlines."
msgstr "[in] 与事务 deadline 相同且有效的单调时间域。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:278
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:284
msgid "Transport, or a zero invalid port for missing methods."
msgstr "返回 transport；缺少方法时返回无效的零端口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:282
msgid "lsm6dsox_spi.h"
msgstr "lsm6dsox_spi.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:284
msgid "LSM6DSOX over one settled whole-CS SPI endpoint."
msgstr "通过一个返回时已结清、覆盖完整 CS 事务的 SPI endpoint 接入 LSM6DSOX。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:284
msgid "Bind an existing eight-bit polling SPI endpoint."
msgstr "绑定已有的八位 polling SPI endpoint。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:284
msgid ""
"One command plus at most six payload bytes shares CS. Local arrays are "
"released on every return; no async fallback."
msgstr "一条命令及最多六个 payload 字节共用 CS。局部数组在任何返回时均被释放，不进行 async 回退。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:284
msgid "[in] Stable explicit CS, mode 0/3 and reviewed rate."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且明确的 CS、mode 0/3 与已审核速率。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:288
msgid "ov2640.h"
msgstr "ov2640.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "Reviewed ST OV2640 RGB565 profiles over explicit SCCB ports."
msgstr "通过明确的 SCCB 端口提供已审核的 ST OV2640 RGB565 profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "The four complete RGB565 tables reviewed in the locked ST driver."
msgstr "锁定的 ST 驱动中已审核的四套完整 RGB565 表。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "Check exact identity and execute the real locked ST profile table."
msgstr "检查精确身份，并执行真实锁定的 ST profile 表。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid ""
"Task-only synchronous startup, including upstream's200ms reset wait and "
"explicit bounded per-register waits. The caller chooses a suitable "
"maintenance/startup execution context. On first callback failure all later "
"upstream void callbacks suppress physical access and the exact error "
"returns; partial configuration is never reported as initialized. No power, "
"XCLK, DCMI, DMA or buffer is acquired. Config/device/opaque owner extents "
"are disjoint; multiple live instances share only code."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文的同步启动，包含上游 200ms reset "
"等待和显式有界的逐寄存器等待。调用者选择合适的维护／启动执行上下文。首次回调失败后，后续全部上游 void "
"回调均抑制物理访问，并返回具体错误；不会把部分配置报告为已初始化。不取得电源、XCLK、DCMI、DMA 或 "
"buffer。config/device/不透明 owner 存储范围互不重叠；多个 live 实例只共享代码。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "[inout] Zero/stopped or same-binding uncertain sensor."
msgstr "[inout] 零初始化／已停止的传感器，或同一绑定下状态不确定的传感器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "[in] Stable reviewed binding/profile through successful stop."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已审核的 binding/profile，保留至 stop 成功。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "[in] Finite whole-operation absolute port-clock budget."
msgstr "[in] 端口时钟域中覆盖完整操作的有限绝对预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID/TIMEOUT before admission, BUSY for live ownership, "
"UNSUPPORTED for exact identity mismatch, or first port/time error."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；准入前的 INVALID/TIMEOUT；已有 live 所有权时的 BUSY；精确身份不匹配时的 "
"UNSUPPORTED；或首个端口／时间错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "Enter sensor soft standby and verify the selected source predicate."
msgstr "让传感器进入软待机，并核验选定的源状态谓词。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid ""
"Caller first closes and joins DCMI/DMA/IRQ and every frame consumer; this "
"control operation cannot revoke those independent loans. Uses sensor-bank "
"COM2 read/modify/write, preserving drive bits. It does not remove "
"power/XCLK, stop shared SCCB or infer physical quiescence from elapsed time."
" Failed stop retains binding for explicit owner recovery."
msgstr ""
"调用者先关闭 DCMI/DMA/IRQ 并会合它们及全部帧消费者；该控制操作不能撤销这些独立借用。使用 sensor-bank COM2 "
"的读／改／写，保留驱动位。不会移除电源／XCLK、停止共享 SCCB，或根据经过的时间推断物理静默。stop 失败保留绑定，供 owner 显式恢复。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "[inout] Same sole task after capture source/users have joined."
msgstr "[inout] 采集源／用户完成退出会合后的同一独占任务。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup budget in the original live clock domain."
msgstr "[in] 原始有效时钟域中的有限清理预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "SUCCESS after COM2 standby readback; exact retained error otherwise."
msgstr "COM2 待机回读成立后返回 SUCCESS；否则返回需保留处理责任的具体错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "Exact settled8-bit subaddress/data control and bounded external wait."
msgstr "精确、返回时已结清的 8-bit 子地址／数据控制，以及有界外部等待。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid ""
"All calls use one ordinary serialized executor across this supplier bridge's"
" instances. The port addresses the selected OV2640 SCCB child (write "
"ID0x60/read ID0x61), never a NACK-ignoring I2C fallback. Reads preserve "
"output on failure; wait_ms releases all arguments before returning and obeys"
" its declared finite budget and unchanged deadline. Clock, callback code and"
" opaque context survive successful stop. An application may adapt "
"nx_software_sccb_*_register directly; this port starts no bus, GPIO, sensor "
"clock, capture engine, task or allocation."
msgstr ""
"所有调用在该供应商桥接的各实例间共用一个普通串行执行者。端口寻址选定的 OV2640 SCCB child（write ID0x60/read "
"ID0x61），不回退到忽略 NACK 的 I2C。读取失败保持输出不变；wait_ms 返回前释放全部参数，遵守声明的有限预算且不改变 "
"deadline。时钟、回调代码与不透明 context 保留至 stop 成功。应用可直接适配 "
"nx_software_sccb_*_register；该端口不启动总线、GPIO、传感器时钟、采集引擎、任务或分配存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "Immutable exact control profile, retained until successful stop."
msgstr "不可变的精确控制 profile，保留至 stop 成功。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid ""
"External reset/supply and6..24MHz XCLK are stable before init. XCLK and "
"PCB/data-lane facts are product responsibilities; frequency is an explicit "
"declared input, not generated/physically measured here. expected_pid_l is "
"the reviewed module revision's exact product ID LSB; datasheet1.6 "
"specifies0x41. No probe scan, revision or mode fallback. QQVGA160x120 RGB565"
" uses38400 bytes; QVGA320x240 uses153600 bytes and cannot fit F407's128KiB "
"DMA main SRAM. Bigger frames need independently admitted memory. Format "
"is8-bit DVP, RGB565 low byte first; selected capture "
"layout/polarities/bandwidth need separate admission. No JPEG, gapless "
"frames, PCLK frequency or physical timing is claimed."
msgstr ""
"init 前外部 reset/supply 与 6..24MHz XCLK 已稳定。XCLK 和 "
"PCB／数据线事实由产品负责；频率是明确声明的输入，此处不生成或物理测量。expected_pid_l 是已审核模块修订的精确产品 ID "
"低字节；数据手册 1.6 规定为 0x41。不扫描探测，也不回退到其他修订或模式。QQVGA160x120 RGB565 使用 38400 "
"bytes；QVGA320x240 使用 153600 bytes，无法放入 F407 的 128KiB DMA 主 "
"SRAM。更大帧需要独立准入的内存。格式为 8-bit DVP、RGB565 低字节在前；选定采集布局／极性／带宽需单独准入。不声明 "
"JPEG、无间隙帧、PCLK 频率或物理时序。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid "Caller-owned per-sensor state; zero before first initialization."
msgstr "调用者提供的每传感器独立状态；首次初始化前置零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:290
msgid ""
"Software readiness means the exact table and readbacks completed. An error "
"retains immutable binding and uncertain source responsibility; no MCU "
"payload reference survives these settled control calls."
msgstr "软件就绪表示精确表和回读已完成。错误保留不可变绑定与不确定的源恢复责任；这些返回时已结清的控制调用不保留 MCU payload 引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:294
msgid "wm8978.h"
msgstr "wm8978.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Selected WM8978 slave-I2S stereo OUT1 playback control."
msgstr "选定的 WM8978 slave-I2S 立体声 OUT1 播放控制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Cooperative reference charging, ready and uncertain control states."
msgstr "协作式推进的参考电压充电、就绪与不确定控制状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Reset, mute outputs and begin explicit VMID reference charging."
msgstr "复位、静音输出，并显式开始 VMID 参考电压充电。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"No sleep, clock generation, task, allocation or automatic replay. Once a "
"control write is attempted, failure retains UNCERTAIN binding. The9-bit "
"register data is encoded in the actual two-wire byte format."
msgstr ""
"不 sleep、生成时钟、创建任务、分配存储或自动重放。控制写入一旦尝试，失败就保留 UNCERTAIN 绑定。9-bit "
"寄存器数据按真实双线字节格式编码。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[in] Stable reviewed control/clock settings through stop."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已审核的控制／时钟设置，保留至 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[in] Finite absolute budget covering startup and VMID wait."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖启动与 VMID 等待的有限绝对预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"SUCCESS awaiting service, INVALID/TIMEOUT before effects, BUSY for "
"active/rebound ownership, or exact settled I2C/time failure."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示等待 service；产生效果前的 INVALID/TIMEOUT；已有活动／重新绑定所有权时的 BUSY；或返回时已结清的具体 "
"I2C／时间错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Finish selected muted playback configuration after VMID wait."
msgstr "VMID 等待结束后，完成选定的静音播放配置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"Uses original whole-startup deadline. Default OUT1 gain is-57dB and muted; "
"explicitly choose gain and unmute only after PCM is ready."
msgstr "使用原始的整段启动 deadline。默认 OUT1 增益为 -57dB 且保持静音；PCM 就绪后才显式选择增益并解除静音。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[inout] Same task/binding and original clock epoch."
msgstr "[inout] 同一任务／绑定与原始 clock epoch。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "BUSY before ready_at, SUCCESS in READY, or exact error."
msgstr "ready_at 前返回 BUSY，READY 状态返回 SUCCESS，或返回具体错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Stage stereo headphone gain then latch both channels together."
msgstr "暂存立体声耳机增益，再同时锁存两个通道。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"1 dB steps, no zero-cross waiting; current explicit mute is preserved. "
"Success means register writes settled, not acoustic gain measurement."
msgstr "步进为 1 dB，不等待过零；保留当前显式 mute 状态。成功表示寄存器写入已结清，不是声学增益测量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[inout] Same READY task owner."
msgstr "[inout] 同一 READY 任务 owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[in] Integer gain from -57 through +6 dB."
msgstr "[in] -57 至 +6 dB 的整数增益。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[in] Finite whole-update absolute deadline."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖完整更新的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "SUCCESS or exact validation/control/time failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或具体的校验／控制／时间错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Explicitly select digital soft mute and OUT1 analogue mute."
msgstr "显式选择数字 soft mute 和 OUT1 模拟 mute。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"Muting starts with DAC soft mute; unmuting clears soft mute last. This does "
"not drain I2S/DMA, stop power or establish electrical safety."
msgstr "静音时先启用 DAC soft mute；解除静音时最后清除 soft mute。这不排空 I2S/DMA、不关闭电源，也不证明电气安全。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[in] Product-selected mute state; no automatic unmute."
msgstr "[in] 产品选定的 mute 状态；不自动解除静音。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "SUCCESS or exact control/time failure, retaining uncertain binding."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或保留不确定绑定的具体控制／时间错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Mute outputs and disable power registers before releasing binding."
msgstr "释放绑定前，静音输出并关闭电源寄存器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"Failure retains config and recovery responsibility; caller retries only "
"after restoring its physical owner. Does not stop shared I2C, remove power, "
"discharge VMID, alter pins or reclaim a PCM loan."
msgstr ""
"失败保留配置和恢复责任；调用者仅在恢复其物理 owner 后重试。不停止共享 I2C、移除电源、使 VMID 放电、改变 pin 或回收 PCM 借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[inout] Same task after PCM/DMA and all users have joined."
msgstr "[inout] PCM/DMA 与全部用户完成退出会合后的同一任务。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup budget, independent of startup deadline."
msgstr "[in] 与启动 deadline 独立的有限清理预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "SUCCESS only after all control writes settle, otherwise exact error."
msgstr "全部控制写入结清后才返回 SUCCESS；否则返回具体错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Exact write-only codec control binding and selected external clocks."
msgstr "精确的只写 Codec 控制绑定，以及选定的外部时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"Endpoint is the reviewed7-bit WM8978 address0x1a. Clock and endpoint use one"
" monotonic domain. Supply and MCLK are already stable; product owns I2S "
"data/clock pins and keeps PCM stopped during initialization. This profile "
"selects48kHz nominal, external MCLK/256, no codec PLL, slave I2S, stereo "
"DAC-to-OUT1, no1.5x output boost. The actual mclk_hz must be within explicit"
" maximum_clock_error_ppm (0..1000) of12.288MHz. vmid_settle_us is a positive"
" product-qualified bound for its VMID capacitor/reference impedance; no "
"generic settling time is invented. word_bits is16/20/24/32; selected I2S "
"provider must independently support its wire layout. ADC/microphone, speaker"
" OUT2, EQ and PLL are unselected. Immutable config, faces and opaque "
"contexts live until successful stop."
msgstr ""
"endpoint 为已审核的 7-bit WM8978 地址 0x1a。时钟与 endpoint 使用同一单调时间域。供电和 MCLK 已稳定；产品拥有"
" I2S 数据／时钟 pin，并在初始化期间保持 PCM 停止。本 profile 选择名义 48kHz、外部 MCLK/256、不使用 Codec "
"PLL、slave I2S、立体声 DAC-to-OUT1，并且不启用 1.5x 输出提升。实际 mclk_hz 与 12.288MHz "
"的误差必须在明确的 maximum_clock_error_ppm（0..1000）内。vmid_settle_us 是产品针对其 VMID "
"电容／参考阻抗验证过的正数上界；不虚构通用稳定时间。word_bits 为 16/20/24/32；选定 I2S provider "
"必须独立支持其线上布局。不选择 ADC／麦克风、扬声器 OUT2、EQ 或 PLL。不可变配置、face 与不透明 context 保留至 stop "
"成功。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid "Caller-owned exact state; zero before first initialization."
msgstr "调用者提供的精确状态；首次初始化前置零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:296
msgid ""
"One nonreentrant ordinary task owns all calls and PCM admission. Write-only "
"register acceptance cannot prove codec identity, clock fitting, analogue "
"settling, acoustic output or mute effectiveness. Fields are internal "
"observations, never permission to rebind/reclaim. Failure retains the same "
"binding until stop succeeds; clock rollback latches a terminal domain error "
"that numeric time recovery cannot undo."
msgstr ""
"一个不可重入的普通任务拥有全部调用与 PCM 准入。只写寄存器的接纳结果不能证明 Codec "
"身份、时钟实装、模拟稳定、声学输出或静音有效性。字段是内部观察，不授予重新绑定／回收权限。失败保留同一绑定，直至 stop 成功；clock "
"rollback 锁存终止性的时间域错误，数值恢复不能撤销该错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:300
msgid "esp_at.h"
msgstr "esp_at.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Selected ESP32-C3 ESP-AT 4.1.1.0 single TCP module profile."
msgstr "选定 ESP32-C3 ESP-AT 4.1.1.0 的单 TCP 模块 profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Explicit ordinary task phase, not a hardware qualification."
msgstr "显式的普通任务阶段，不代表硬件资格。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Bind a selected firmware profile without probing/resetting hardware."
msgstr "绑定选定固件 profile，不探测或复位硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"Single serialized task owns all methods and the underlying UART. Buffers, "
"UART/context and clock outlive every upper consumer and close. Power, reset,"
" UART pins/rate/flow control and initial drained boundary are product facts."
" This profile selects active receive, single TCP, normal transmission and "
"ESP32-C3 version 4.1.1.0; no scan or fallback."
msgstr ""
"同一个串行任务拥有全部方法及底层 UART。缓冲区、UART/context 和时钟的生命周期须覆盖所有上层消费者和 close。供电、复位、UART "
"引脚／速率／流控及初始排空边界均由产品明确。此 profile 选择主动接收、单 TCP、普通传输及 ESP32-C3 4.1.1.0 "
"版本；不扫描或回退。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[out] Unused/quiescent caller state, disjoint from all buffers."
msgstr "[out] 未使用且已静止的调用者状态，与全部缓冲区互不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"[in] Stable UART/clock, line >=128 B, command >=224 B, positive RX and "
"1..8192 B copied TX capacities."
msgstr ""
"[in] 稳定的 UART/clock；line 至少 128 B，command 至少 224 B，RX 容量为正，复制 TX 容量为 1..8192"
" B。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID with no UART I/O or allocation."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID，不进行 UART I/O 或分配。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Admit GMR verification and the fixed volatile station/TCP setup."
msgstr "准入 GMR 验证及固定的易失 station/TCP 配置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"Setup selects SYSSTORE=0, CWMODE=1,0, CIPMUX=0, CIPMODE=0, CIPDINFO=0 and "
"CIPRECVTYPE=0 only after the exact GMR profile matches."
msgstr ""
"仅在 GMR 精确匹配所选 profile 后，配置 "
"SYSSTORE=0、CWMODE=1,0、CIPMUX=0、CIPMODE=0、CIPDINFO=0 和 CIPRECVTYPE=0。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[inout] Initialized COLD same-owner state."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 COLD 状态，由同一个 owner 访问。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Finite total setup deadline in the UART clock domain."
msgstr "[in] UART 时钟域内、覆盖整个配置过程的有限 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means command accepted, not READY; INVALID/STATE/BUSY or TIMEOUT "
"before effects. service explicitly advances the sequence."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示命令已接受，并非 READY；产生副作用前可返回 INVALID/STATE/BUSY 或 TIMEOUT。通过显式 service"
" 推进序列。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Copy an explicit station join command without retaining credentials."
msgstr "复制显式的 station 入网命令，不保留凭据引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"No credential is logged or persisted by this wrapper. The selected module "
"command buffer holds credentials until join completion/recovery; product "
"controls access to UART/storage and authorizes network choice."
msgstr "此封装不记录或持久化任何凭据。选定模块命令缓冲区在入网完成／恢复前保存凭据；产品负责控制 UART／存储访问并授权网络选择。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[inout] READY metadata, no TCP user or command active."
msgstr "[inout] READY 元数据，且没有 TCP 用户或活动命令。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] 1..32 bytes, no NUL/CR/LF; quotes/comma/backslash escaped."
msgstr "[in] 1..32 字节，不含 NUL/CR/LF；对引号、逗号和反斜杠进行转义。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Exact SSID bytes."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 SSID 字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] 8..63 WPA-PSK bytes or NULL for an open network."
msgstr "[in] 8..63 字节 WPA-PSK；开放网络使用 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Exact password bytes, zero for an open network."
msgstr "[in] 精确的密码字节数；开放网络使用零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Finite whole join deadline, never renewed by URCs."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖整个入网过程的有限 deadline，URC 不会延长该预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "SUCCESS means admission; service waits for OK and WIFI GOT IP."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示已准入；service 等待 OK 和 WIFI GOT IP。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Admit a single IPv4/domain TCP connection using explicit parameters."
msgstr "用显式参数准入一个 IPv4／域名 TCP 连接。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"Hostname resolution belongs to the module. Nexus TLS may consume the "
"returned byte stream with independent trust/time/entropy policy."
msgstr "域名解析由模块负责。Nexus TLS 可使用返回的字节流，信任、时间和熵策略由其独立提供。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[inout] READY with observed Wi-Fi IP and no old session."
msgstr "[inout] READY，已观测到 Wi-Fi IP 且没有旧会话。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] 1..64 ASCII hostname/IPv4 bytes; only letters/digits/.-."
msgstr "[in] 1..64 字节 ASCII 主机名／IPv4，仅允许字母、数字、点和短横线。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Exact host bytes, excludes NUL."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 host 字节数，不含 NUL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Nonzero TCP port."
msgstr "[in] 非零 TCP 端口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Finite whole connection deadline."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖整个连接过程的有限 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "SUCCESS means admission; CONNECT and OK are both required for state."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示已准入；须同时收到 CONNECT 和 OK 才进入连接状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Progress at most io_budget copying UART read/write calls."
msgstr "最多推进 io_budget 次复制型 UART 读／写调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"No worker, wait, heap or command replay. Header parsing handles binary "
"immediately after ':' in the same read. RX overflow, malformed length, "
"unexpected reset/URC, timeout or loss closes admission until recovery. SEND "
"OK means module stack admission, not peer delivery."
msgstr ""
"不创建 worker、不等待、不使用堆、不重放命令。头部解析支持同一次读取中紧随 ':' 的二进制数据。RX "
"溢出、长度畸形、非预期复位／URC、超时或丢失均关闭准入，直至显式恢复。SEND OK 表示模块协议栈已接受，不代表对端收到。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[inout] Live same-owner metadata and buffers."
msgstr "[inout] 存活的元数据和缓冲区，由同一个 owner 访问。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Finite service budget, capped by an active operation."
msgstr "[in] 有限 service 预算，不得超出活动操作的预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Positive maximum individual transport calls."
msgstr "[in] 单次 transport 调用次数的正上限。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "SUCCESS for progress, BUSY for no progress, or latched failure."
msgstr "有进展返回 SUCCESS，无进展返回 BUSY，或返回锁存的失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Query the existing readonly copied socket face without I/O."
msgstr "查询已有的只读复制型 socket face，不进行 I/O。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"Task-only immediate calls retain no caller buffers. Writes copy at most the "
"selected TX capacity and wait for explicit service. Remote CLOSED drains "
"copied RX before EOF; failed sessions report error."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文可调用，方法立即返回且不保留调用者缓冲区。写入最多复制所选 TX 容量，之后等待显式 service。远端 CLOSED 后先排空已复制 "
"RX，再返回 EOF；失败会话报告错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Initialized state, retained through all consumers."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化状态，在所有消费者退出前持续保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Stable face or NULL for invalid/uninitialized metadata."
msgstr "返回稳定的 face；元数据无效或未初始化时返回 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Admit explicit close after every upper consumer and TX user joined."
msgstr "所有上层消费者和 TX 用户均已退出会合后，准入显式 close。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"service waits for real CLOSED and OK. CLOSED is terminal for this session: "
"product drains/resets to a known boundary before recovery and another "
"connection; no late URC can silently bind a new socket."
msgstr ""
"service 等待真实的 CLOSED 和 OK。CLOSED 是此会话的终态：产品须排空／复位至已知边界后，才能恢复并再次连接；迟到 URC "
"不能悄然绑定到新 socket。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[inout] CONNECTED with no pending copied TX, or CLOSED."
msgstr "[inout] 没有待处理复制 TX 的 CONNECTED 状态，或 CLOSED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Finite close deadline; old operations are not renewed."
msgstr "[in] 有限的 close deadline；不会延长旧操作的预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "SUCCESS admits close/already closed; BUSY/STATE or actual failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示关闭已准入或已关闭；也可返回 BUSY/STATE 或实际失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Reset software after actual external module/UART synchronization."
msgstr "在实际完成外部模块／UART 同步后，复位软件状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"Product first drains/joins transport and resets the module to its known "
"boundary. This performs no reset, power action or hardware join. Pending TX "
"is abandoned only after that proof and is never replayed. Next use "
"explicitly runs configure; initialized buffers remain caller-owned."
msgstr ""
"产品先排空／会合 transport，并将模块复位至已知边界。本操作不执行复位、供电操作或硬件会合。仅在上述证明成立后放弃待发送 "
"TX，且绝不重放。下次使用须显式执行 configure；已初始化缓冲区仍归调用者所有。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[inout] Same original metadata, all calls/consumers joined."
msgstr "[inout] 原来的同一份元数据，且所有调用／消费者均已退出会合。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, INVALID or STATE for an invalid clock history."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、BUSY、INVALID；时钟历史无效时返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Copy selected facts and current local state in the owning task."
msgstr "在所属任务内复制选定事实和当前本地状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid ""
"Observation does not join callbacks, certify firmware or grant release."
msgstr "观测不会会合回调、认证固件或授予释放权限。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[in] Initialized stable serialized metadata."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化、稳定且串行访问的元数据。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "[out] Disjoint output; unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 不重叠的输出；拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or BUSY inside a live service call."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID；在活动 service 调用内返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Exact caller buffers and an already owned copying UART stream."
msgstr "明确的调用者缓冲区，以及已取得所有权的复制型 UART 流。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Copied observations; no method proves remote application delivery."
msgstr "复制的观测值；任何方法都不能证明远端应用已收到数据。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:302
msgid "Selected-only caller state; all fields private after initialization."
msgstr "仅服务于选定 profile 的调用者状态；初始化后全部字段均为私有。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:306
msgid "atecc608b.h"
msgstr "atecc608b.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Read-only locked ATECC608B profile and opaque P256 signer."
msgstr "只读、已锁定的 ATECC608B profile 及不透明 P256 signer。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Consumer supplies the exact current operation, NULL outside calls."
msgstr "消费者提供当前精确操作；调用外返回 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid ""
"Explicit static-binding function, like a volume-operation getter. Do not "
"change or reclaim it until the entire component call returns."
msgstr "显式静态绑定函数，与 volume-operation getter 类似。整个组件调用返回前，不得改变或回收它。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Stable caller scope naming this device and finite deadline."
msgstr "指明此设备及有限 deadline 的稳定调用者 scope。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Exact fixed-profile workspace size; no heap or global packet pool."
msgstr "固定 profile 所需的精确 workspace 大小；不使用堆或全局 packet pool。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Required private-workspace alignment."
msgstr "私有 workspace 所需的对齐。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Verify exact B revision, both lock bytes, serial and signing slot."
msgstr "验证精确的 B revision、两个 lock byte、序列号和签名 slot。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid ""
"Only Info and Config reads are issued. 00006003 is the reviewed B DevRev. "
"Both zone lock bytes and the selected SlotLocked bit must be zero. The slot "
"must be private, secret P256 with ExternalSign and public-info, and no "
"selected auth/random requirement. Argument/time preflight failures retain "
"nothing. After physical access starts, any failure retains this binding, "
"unready, for explicit stop. No provisioning, key generation, Lock, Write, "
"OTP or reset is exposed."
msgstr ""
"仅发出 Info 和 Config 读取。00006003 是已审核的 B DevRev。两个 zone lock byte 和所选 "
"SlotLocked bit 都必须为零。slot 必须为 private、secret P256，允许 ExternalSign 和 public-"
"info，且未启用认证／随机数前置要求。参数／时间前置检查失败不保留任何引用。物理访问开始后，任何失败均保留此绑定并置为未就绪，供显式 stop "
"清理。不暴露 provision、密钥生成、Lock、Write、OTP 或 reset。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero identity, with no concurrent face users."
msgstr "[inout] 全新且全零的 identity，不存在并发 face 用户。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[in] Complete stable binding, copied during this call."
msgstr "[in] 完整、稳定的绑定，在本次调用内复制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[inout] Aligned caller storage, retained while bound."
msgstr "[inout] 对齐的调用者存储，绑定期间须保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[in] At least the exact workspace size."
msgstr "[in] 不小于精确 workspace 大小。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[in] Finite whole-operation monotonic budget, matching scope."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖整个操作的有限单调预算，与 scope 一致。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED or transport error."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED 或 transport 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Return the existing ready readonly signer face, or NULL if unready."
msgstr "返回已有、就绪且只读的 signer face；未就绪时返回 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid ""
"Join every face user before stop or workspace reuse. A returned face retains"
" no new hardware ownership and exposes no key bytes or SDK type."
msgstr "stop 或复用 workspace 前须会合全部 face 用户。返回的 face 不新增硬件所有权，且不暴露密钥字节或 SDK 类型。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[in] Stable bound device, serialized with calls and stop."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的已绑定设备；调用和 stop 串行执行。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Existing face without clock, probing, allocation or initialization."
msgstr "返回已有 face，不读取时钟、探测、分配或初始化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Copy cached successful initialization identity without hardware I/O."
msgstr "复制成功初始化时缓存的身份，不执行硬件 I/O。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid ""
"Cached facts do not detect replacement, authenticate hardware or prove "
"private-key possession. Actual public-key/sign operations read hardware."
msgstr "缓存事实不能检测器件替换、认证硬件或证明私钥持有。实际 public-key/sign 操作会访问硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[in] Bound ready same-executor device."
msgstr "[in] 已绑定且就绪的设备，由同一个执行者访问。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[out] Separate copied facts, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立的事实副本；拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; no retained output."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；不保留输出。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Close signing admission and request explicit device sleep."
msgstr "关闭签名准入，并显式请求设备 sleep。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid ""
"Synchronous I2C buffers are settled on every return. Failed sleep leaves "
"device state uncertain and retains workspace/ports. No key material is "
"erased, generated, exported or reprovisioned. A stopped component needs "
"explicit reinitialization before signing again."
msgstr ""
"每次返回时，同步 I2C 缓冲区均已结清。sleep 失败会使设备状态不确定，并保留 workspace／端口。不擦除、生成、导出或重新 "
"provision 密钥。已停止的组件须显式重新初始化后，才能再次签名。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[inout] Same bound identity after all other users join."
msgstr "[inout] 全部其他用户退出会合后的同一份已绑定 identity。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "[in] Fresh finite cleanup budget, matching active scope."
msgstr "[in] 新的有限清理预算，与活动 scope 一致。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "SUCCESS clears the binding; failure retains it for cleanup retry."
msgstr "SUCCESS 清除绑定；失败则保留绑定，供重试清理。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Public readback facts, not a secret or anti-counterfeit proof."
msgstr "公开的读回事实，不是秘密，也不是防伪证明。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Device identity references caller private workspace while bound."
msgstr "绑定期间，设备 identity 引用调用者的私有 workspace。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Explicit settled wire, timing and key-slot binding."
msgstr "显式绑定已结清的线路接口、时间与密钥 slot。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid ""
"Polling endpoint transactions release every MCU buffer before return. Wake "
"callback creates the selected electrical pulse and tWHI wait; the component "
"verifies the four-byte wake response itself. Delay waits the requested "
"microseconds or returns an error within the same finite deadline. Both "
"callbacks are task-only and retain no arguments. Maximum_polls bounds "
"receive attempts across one public operation. One physical device has one "
"live component owner, with one selected key. Slot 0..15 must already hold an"
" approved locked private P256 key. Endpoint/ops, active scope, device and "
"used workspace stay stable and disjoint. Opaque endpoint/clock/callback "
"contexts also stay disjoint from mutable workspace, device and outputs; "
"callers check their full extents because the component cannot inspect "
"private context sizes."
msgstr ""
"polling endpoint 事务在返回前释放每个 MCU 缓冲区。wake 回调产生所选电气脉冲并等待 tWHI；组件自行验证四字节 wake "
"响应。delay 在同一有限 deadline "
"内等待请求的微秒数，或返回错误。两个回调都仅在任务上下文使用，且不保留任何参数。Maximum_polls "
"限制单次公共操作的接收尝试次数。同一物理设备只有一个存活的组件 owner，并选择一个 key。slot 0..15 必须已持有获准且已锁定的私有 "
"P256 密钥。Endpoint/ops、活动 scope、device 和使用中的 workspace 须保持稳定且互不重叠。不透明的 "
"endpoint/clock/callback context 也须与可变 workspace、device 和输出互不重叠；组件无法检查私有 "
"context 的大小，因此其完整范围由调用者检查。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid "Consumer-owned active operation for vendor context-free delay hooks."
msgstr "消费者拥有的活动操作，供供应商无 context 的 delay hook 使用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/devices.md:308
msgid ""
"One execution domain explicitly publishes this scope before entering a "
"component call and withdraws it after return. No concurrent operation or "
"other CryptoAuthLib instance may replace it. This is not a library current-"
"device global, thread-local registry or execution sandbox."
msgstr ""
"同一个执行域在进入组件调用前显式发布此 scope，并在返回后撤回。并发操作或其他 CryptoAuthLib 实例不得替换它。此机制不是库的全局 "
"current-device、线程局部注册表或执行沙箱。"
